<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Yuba Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Yubaa Fe Taruxuna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuba</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Yubaa Fe Taruxuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito Yuba nan ma fe taruxun yɛbama. A a tinxinna nan ma fe singe falama. Yuba findi dɛnkɛlɛya muxun nan na e nun nafulu kanna a dunuɲa yi gidini. Koni Setana yi Ala maxɔdin xa a tinxinyaan mi yi fataxi a nafulu kanyaan na. Ala yi tin Setana xa Yuba mato xa a dɛnkɛlɛyɛ yiigelitɔyani. A yii seene nun a diine nun a kɛndɛyaan birin yi ba a yii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nayi, Yuba nun a xɔyine yi lu e bode matandɛ fa fala a tɔrɔxi naxan na. A xɔyine yi a fala a Yubaa yulubine nan a ligaxi a tɔrɔxi. Yuba xɔyine dunuɲa muxune xaxinle nan falama hali Ala gbeene mi ne ra! Yuba xɔyine mi yi laxi a ra xa tinxin muxun na tɔrɔ sifan sɔtɛ. Yuba xɔyi saxan yi kata alogo e xa a xaxili ragidi fa fala tɔrɔn naxan a fari, na fataxi yulubina nde nan na a naxan ligaxi. Nayi, fe matandi gbeen yi fɔlɔ fala ɲaxumɛ wuyaxi naxan yi. A xɔyi saxanne yi lu muxune miriyane falɛ naxanye nun ɲɔndin maliga, koni Yuba tan yi e matandi Ala kɛɲana fe yi, a mɔn naxa a a tan mi sese ligaxi a ɲaxin na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yubaa falane yi, Marigi Yesu a fe falama benun a xa liga bayo Yuba a falama a xunbamana nde na yi naxan Ala solonama muxune xa. Na feen sɛbɛxi Yuba 9.33 nun 16.19-21 nun 19.25 kui e nun Yuba 17.3.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muxu gbɛtɛ fan yi basan falan na naxan xili Elihu. Na fan Yuba matandi nɛn. A yi a fala a Ala tɔrɔn nafama muxun ma nɛn alogo a xa a sɔnna yita a ra, anu muxu yo mi lan a xa Ala maxɔdin na ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dɔnxɛn na, Ala yɛtɛɛn yi falan ti. Koni a mi tin maxɔdinne yabɛ Yuba nun a xɔyine maxɔdinna naxanye ti. Benun na, Ala nan Yuba maxɔdin dunuɲa da feene ma. Nayi, Yuba yi a Ala kolon dunuɲa da mangan na. Nayi, muxun lan a xa lu dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun tinxinna fari hali a tɔrɔxi.</para>
  <para style="ip">A raɲanna ra, Ala naxa, a Yuba nan keden a fe falaxi a kiini. Yuba bɔnɔ seen naxanye birin yi, a yi ne ɲɔxɔn dɔxɔde firin so a yii. Na feen sɛbɛxi Yuba 42.7-17 kui.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba nun a denbayana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Xɛmɛna nde yi Yusu yamanani, a yi xili Yuba. Fɛ mi yi na xɛmɛn na, muxu faɲin nan yi a ra, a yi gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra, a yi fe ɲaxin matangama. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>A dii xɛmɛ solofere nun dii tɛmɛ saxan nan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Yɛxɛɛn wuli solofere yi a yii, e nun ɲɔgɔmɛn wuli saxan nun tura kɛmɛ suulun nun sofali gilɛ kɛmɛ suulun e nun walikɛ wuyaxi. Muxu gbeen nan yi xɛmɛni ito ra dangu sogeteden muxune birin na.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>A dii xɛmɛne yi e malanma e bode kon yi donse dondeni waxatin birin, e yi xɛraan nasigama e magilɛ saxanne ma nɛn alogo e xa fa e dɛge, e min e bode xɔn. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Donse don lɔxɔne na yi dangu, Yuba yi a diine xilima nɛn alogo a xa e rasariɲan. A yi kelima nɛn xɔtɔn, a yi saraxa gan daxin ba e birin xa, amasɔtɔ Yuba yi mirixi a ma fa fala, “Waxatina nde, n ma diine bata yulubin tongo, e fala ɲaxin ti Ala ma e bɔɲɛni.” Yuba yi na nan ligama waxatin birin.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Lɔxɔna nde, malekane yi fa e malan Alatala yɛtagi, Setana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.6</char> <char style="fk">Setana</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Muxu magina” hanma “Tɔɲɛgɛlana.”</note> fan yi fa e yɛ. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Alatala yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “I kelixi minɛn?” Setana yi Alatala yabi, a naxa, “N kelixi bɔxɔn xun xɔn, n masiga tideni.” <verse eid="JOB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Alatala yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “I bata n ma walikɛɛn Yuba rakɔrɔsi ba? Muxu yo mi luxi alo a tan bɔxɔn fari, sɔntaren nun muxu faɲin na a ra, naxan gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra, a fe ɲaxin matangama.” <verse eid="JOB 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Setana yi Alatala yabi, a naxa, “Yuba gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra nɛn tun ba? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>I mi a makantanxi ba, e nun a denbayaan nun a seene birin? I bata barakan sa a feene yi, a xuruseene mɔn wuyama ayi yamanani. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Koni, xa i i yiini bandun, i yi a din a seene ra, a i dangama nɛn.” <verse eid="JOB 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Alatala yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “N bata a yii seene birin sa i sagoni, koni i nama i yii din a gbindin na.” Nayi, Setana yi keli Alatala yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Lɔxɔna nde, Yubaa dii xɛmɛne nun a dii tɛmɛne yi e dɛgema, e manpaan minma e tadaa banxini, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>xɛrana nde yi fa Yuba li, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Turane yi xɛɛ biini, sofali gilɛne yi e dɛgema e dɛxɔn, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Sabe kaane bata e suxu, e siga e ra, e bata i ya walikɛne faxa. N keden peen nan minixi ayi, n faxi nɛn n xa fa na xibarun nali i ma.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>A mɔn yi fala tiini, walikɛ gbɛtɛ yi fa, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Alaa tɛɛn bata godo keli kore, a yi yɛxɛɛne nun walikɛne gan, e birin yi faxa. N keden peen nan a yiminixi, n faxi nɛn n xa fa na xibarun nali i ma.” <verse eid="JOB 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>A mɔn yi fala tiini, walikɛ gbɛtɛ fan yi fa, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Babilɔn kaane malanxin gali saxanna ra, e bata i ya ɲɔgɔmɛne suxu, e siga e ra, e yi i ya walikɛne faxa. N keden peen nan a yiminixi, n faxi nɛn n xa fa na xibarun nali i ma.” <verse eid="JOB 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>A mɔn yi fala tiini, walikɛ gbɛtɛ yi fa, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I ya dii xɛmɛne nun i ya dii tɛmɛne yi e dɛgema, e yi manpaan minma e tadaa banxini. <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>Nanunna, foye gbeen yi fa keli tonbonni, a yi banxin fɔxɔ naaninne birin tuntun, a yi bira e fari, e birin bata faxa. N keden peen nan a yiminixi, n faxi nɛn n xa fa na xibarun nali i ma.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Nayi, Yuba yi keli, a yi a domani bɔ, a yi a xunna bi. Na xanbi ra, a yi bira bɔxɔni, a xinbi sin Ala yɛtagi, <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">“N magenla nan minixi nga kuini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">n magenla nan mɔn sigama laxiraya yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Alatala nan e fixi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Alatala nan e tongoxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Alatala xinla xa tantun.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Na birin yi, Yuba mi yulubin tongo. A mi fala ɲaxi yo ti Ala ma.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa tɔrɔyaan firindena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Lɔxɔna nde, malekane mɔn yi fa e malan Alatala yɛtagi, Setana fan yi fa e yɛ Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Alatala yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “I kelixi minɛn?” Setana yi a yabi, a naxa, “Bɔxɔn xun xɔn, n masiga tideni.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Alatala yi a fala Setana xa, a naxa, “I bata n ma walikɛɛn Yuba rakɔrɔsi ba? Muxu yo mi luxi alo a tan bɔxɔn fari, sɔntaren nun muxu faɲin na a ra, naxan gaxuxi Ala yɛɛ ra, a fe ɲaxin matangama. A mɔn tinxinyani tun, anu i n nadinma a n xa a tɔrɔ a sɔntareyani.” <verse eid="JOB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Setana yi a fala Alatala xa, a naxa, “Muxun yɛtɛɛn nan a fatin na! Muxun naxan birin sɔtɔma, a findima a dunuɲa yi gidin kɔntɔnna nan na. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Koni, xa i yiini bandun, i yi a din a xɔnne nun a fati bɛndɛn na, a fala ɲaxin tima nɛn i ma kɛnɛnni.” <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Alatala yi Setana yabi, a naxa, “Awa, n bata a sa i sagoni, koni i nama a faxa de.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Nayi, Setana yi keli Alatala yɛtagi. Na xanbi ra, a yi sete ɲaxine ramini Yuba fatin birin ma, keli a sanne kui han a xun tagi. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Yuba yi fɛɲɛ fɛrɛnna tongo a xɔlin seen na, a dɔxɔ tɛɛ xubeni. <verse eid="JOB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>A ɲaxanla yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I luma nɛn i ya tinxinni ba? Fala ɲaxin ti Ala ma, i xa faxa!” <verse eid="JOB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Koni, a yi a yabi, a naxa, “I falan tima alo ɲaxalan xaxilitarena! En hɛrin nasuxuma Ala yii, nanfera en mi tɔrɔn nasuxɛ?” Na birin yi, Yuba mi yulubin tongo a fala xuiin xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A xɔyi saxanne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Yuba xɔyi saxanne yi a tɔrɔne birin ma fe mɛ naxanye a sɔtɔ, e yi fa sa keli e yamanane yi, Teman kaana Elifasi nun Suxa kaan Bilidada nun Nama kaan Sofara. E yi lan a ma a e xa sa e xɔyiyaan yita Yuba ra, e yi a madɛndɛn. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>E to sa a to wulani, fayida e mi a kolon. E yi gbelegbele, e yi e dugine yibɔ, e burunburunna sa e xunne yi. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>E yi lu dɔxi a fɛma bɔxɔni xi solofere, kɔɛ solofere. Muxu yo mi sese fala a xa, amasɔtɔ e bata yi a to, a yi tɔrɔxi kii naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa falane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yuba yi a dɛni bi, a yi a bari lɔxɔn danga. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>Yuba yi a fala, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“N bari lɔxɔn xa raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">e nun kɔɛna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">muxune a fala waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">e naxa, ‘Dii xɛmɛn bata bari!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Na lɔxɔn xa findi dimin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">Ala mako nama lu a ma kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">kɛnɛnna nama fa mini a ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Dimi gbeen xa a suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">kunda fɔrɛn yi godo na lɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">han dimin yi sogen suxu.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Na kɔɛɛn xa findi dimi gbeen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">a nama fa yatɛ ɲɛɛn lɔxɔne yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">a nama fa lu kikene yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Na lɔxɔn xa findi gbantan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">sɛwa xui nama lu a yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Naxanye gbalo lɔxɔne fe falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">naxanye fatan ige yi sube ɲaxin naxulunɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">ne xa na lɔxɔn danga.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>A subaxa ma sarene xa yidimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">a yengi xa lu kɛnɛnna xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">koni a nama a to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">a nama xɔtɔnna to.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Amasɔtɔ, a mi sese ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">alogo n nama sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">a bata n lu, n yi sɔxɔlɛni ito sɔtɔ to.”<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Nanfera n mi faxa n to bari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Nanfera n mi faxa n xali lɔxɔni?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Nanfera n bata xinbi firinna li n yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">n nasuxudeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">e nun xiɲɛne alogo n xa xiɲɛn min?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Xa n yi faxa nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">a lima nɛn nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">n saxi n ma gaburun na bɔɲɛ xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">nayi, n yi xima nɛn xaxili sani nun<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>manga fonne fɛma, bɔxɔn kuntigine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">naxanye banxi faɲine tixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">naxanye kalaxin bata lu iki,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>e nun kuntigi fonne fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">xɛmaan yi naxanye yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">naxanye e banxine rafe gbeti fixɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Xanamu, a yi lan nun n mi balo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">alo diin naxan faxaxi barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">a mi kɛnɛnna to.<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Bayo, muxu ɲaxine mi fa walima gaburun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">muxu xadanxine e matabuma dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Kasorasane fan birin yi bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">e mi fa ɲaxankata tiin xuiin mɛma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Sɛnbɛtaren nun sɛnbɛ kanna na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">konyin yi xunba a kanna ma.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>Nanfera Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">i kɛnɛnna fima tɔrɔ muxune ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">Nanfera i siimayaan fima muxu nimisaxine ma,<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>naxanye faxan mamɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">a mi fama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">naxanye sayaan fenma dangu nafunla ra?<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Bayo e yi luma nɛn sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">e na siga laxira yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">e bɔɲɛn yi xunbelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">e na maluxun waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Nanfera muxun luyɛ a nii ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">naxan mi kira yo toma a sigɛ naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">Ala yɛtɛɛn naxan saxi sansanna kui?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>N ma tɔrɔne bata findi n balon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">n gbelegbele xuiin minima alo igena.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>N gaxuxi naxan birin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">na nan n sɔtɔn be.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">N yi gaxuxi tɔrɔn naxanye yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">ne nan n fari be.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>N mi fa raxaraxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">n mi bɔɲɛ xunbelixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">n mi n matabuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">n kɔntɔfilixi yɛyɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi a falan Yuba xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Nayi, Teman kaana Elifasi yi falan tongo, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Xa n falan ti i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">i nɔɛ diɲɛ na ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Koni, nde nɔɛ a dundɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">i bata muxu wuyaxi xaran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">i yi sɛnbɛtarene madɛndɛn,<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>naxanye yi birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">i ya falan yi ne rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">naxanye san yi xadanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">i yi ne mali.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Iki, na bata i fan sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">anu i bata yigitɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">A to i tan li, i yi kɔntɔfili.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>I ya lannantenyaan xa lu i ya Ala yɛɛragaxuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">i ya fɛtareyaan yi findi i yigin na.”<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Awa, i miri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">sɔntaren mundun bata halagi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Muxu faɲin mundun bata raxɔri?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>N naxan nakɔrɔsixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">naxanye hakɛ feene ligama e nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">naxanye ɲaxankatan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">ne na saranna sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Alaa foyen nan e halagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">a xɔlɔn tɛɛn yi e gan.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Ala yatane wurundun xuiin nadunduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">a yi yata sɛnbɛmane ɲinne gira.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Nayi, yatan faxama donsetareyaan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">yatana diine yi xuya ayi.”<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Xibarun bata fa n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">alo wundona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">n tunla bata ɲunuɲunun xuiin mɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Xiyene nɛma fɛ kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">xixɔnla nɛma muxune fari,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>gaxu gbeen yi n suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">n xɔnne birin yi xuruxurun.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Yinnan yi dangu n yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">n fati ma xaben yi ramaxa.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Sena nde yi tixi n yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">n mi yi naxan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">a nininna yi n yɛɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">Na yi madundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">na xanbi ra n yi xuina nde mɛ, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Adamadiin tinxinɲɛ ayi dangu Ala ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Muxun sariɲanɲɛ ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">dangu a Dali Marigin na ba?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Xa Ala mi laxi a walikɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">xa a fe ɲaxin to a malekane yi,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>a fa lɛ muxune ra nayi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">naxanye bɛndɛ banxine kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">naxanye fatiye findixi bɛndɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">naxanye yibutuxunɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">alo laxaturane?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>E faxɛ nɛn lɔxɔ kedenni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">E halagɛ nɛn habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">muxe mi kɔntɔfili e fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>E bubune xidi lutine bata bolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">e faxama nɛn e fekolontareyani.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Iki, xinla ti i mali feen na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Muxuna nde na ba naxan i yabɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">I falan tima maleka sariɲanxin mundun xa?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Fe matandin nan xaxilitaren faxama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">Xɔxɔlɔnya gbeen yi kɔmɔn faxa.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>N xaxilitaren to nɛn sabatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">koni dangan so nɛn a banxini xulɛn.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Mali ti yo mi a diine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">e bata yalagi taan kitisadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">muxu yo mi e xunba!<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Kamɛtɔne a sansi bogine donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Hali naxanye ɲanle tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">e yi ne birin tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">yiigelitɔne yi a yiiseene tongo.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Hakɛn mi kelima bɔxɔn xan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">sɔxɔlɛn mi solima bɔxɔni.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Muxun daxi sɔxɔlɛn nan xili yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">alo tɛɛ budone to tuganma ayi.”<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>“Xa n tan na yi a ra nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">n yi Ala nan maxandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">n yi n ma kɔntɔfinla yita Ala ra.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>A feen naxanye ligama ne gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">e mi yɛɛ toɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">a kabanako feene dan mi na.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>A tulen nafama bɔxɔn fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">a igen nafa xɛɛne ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Muxun naxanye magodoxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">a ne yite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">Naxanye sunuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">a kisin fi ne ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>A muxu kɔtaxine miriyane kalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">e mi nɔ sɔtɔma e feene yi.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>A xaxilimane suxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">e yɛtɛna kɔtɛne nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">kɔtadene fe yitɔnxine kalama nɛn xulɛn.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>E soma dimini yanyi tagin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">e tantanma yanyi tagini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">alo kɔɛɛn na a ra.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Koni, a tan tɔrɔ muxun natangama fala ɲaxin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">naxan luxi alo silanfanna,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.15</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">a e rakisi sɛnbɛ kanna ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Nayi, yigin sɛnbɛtaren xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">koni fala mi tinxintaren dɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Nayi, sɛwan na kanna xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Ala na naxan natɔrɔn!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">I nama i mɛ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna a xurun na.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Amasɔtɔ a tan nan maxɔlɔn tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">a yi dandanna ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">A tan nan faxan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">a mɔn yi marakisin ti.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>A i rakisɛ nɛn tɔrɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">dɔxɔɲa ma sennin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">a i ratanga fe ɲaxin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">dɔxɔɲa ma solofere.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>A i rakisima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">faxan ma fitina kamɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">a i rakisi silanfanna ma yɛngɛni.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>A i ratangama nɛn fala ɲaxin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">i mi gaxuma halagin waxatini.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Halagin nun fitina kamɛn bɔtɛ mi luma i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">i mi gaxuma burunna subene yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Gɛmɛ mi taranma i ya xɛɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">hali burunna subene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">yɛngɛ mi luma ɛ nun ne tagi.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbenla luma nɛn i konni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">I na i ya xuruseene xun mato a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">i a lima nɛn sese mi dasaxi.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>I ya diine wuyama ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">i yixɛtɛne yigboma ayi nɛn alo sɛxɛna.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>I faxama foriyaan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">alo murutuna a xaba waxatini.”<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Nxɔ fe xɔnfenna xun soon nan na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">I tuli mati na ra, i xaxili sɔtɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabina Elifasi xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Yuba yi a yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>“N yi wama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">n ma sunun yatɛn xa kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">n ma tɔrɔn yi sa sikeela kanke ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>A yi binyama ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">dangu baan ɲɛmɛnsinna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">Nanara, n ma falan bata radangu ayi.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Ɲɔndin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna bata n sɔxɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">a xalimakunle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">e xɔlɛn yi so n niini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">n bata gaxu gbalone yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Ala naxanye rafama n xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Burunna sofanla luyɛ wugɛ sɛxɛ sabatixini ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Ɲingen wugɛ sɛxɛ xɔnla ma sɛxɛni ba?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Donseen naxan mi ɲaxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">na donɲɛ ba xa fɔxɔ mi a yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Silon xinden ɲaxun muxun dɛ ba?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>N mi yi waxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">n yiin din feni na donseene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">N ma tɔrɔn bata findi donseen na n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">naxan mi ɲaxun!”<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>“N waxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">n ma maxɔdinna xa yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">Ala yi n waxɔn feen liga n xa.<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>A xa Ala kɛnɛn, a yi n faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">A xa a yiini bandun, a yi n naɲan.<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Nayi, n bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">n sɛwa n ma tɔrɔ ɲantareni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">bayo n mi n mɛma Ala sariɲanxina falane ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>N sɛnbɛn bata ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">n yi yigitɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">N naɲanna findima nanse ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">n to luma n nii ra?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>N sɛnbɛn luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">alo gɛmɛ xɔdɛxɛn ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">N fati bɛndɛn findixi sulan nan na ba?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>N mali se yo mi fa n yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">hali a xuridina, a mi fa n yii.”<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>“Muxun naxan yigitɛgɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">na lan a hinanna sɔtɔ a xɔyine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">hali a na a mɛ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna yɛɛragaxun na.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Anu, n xɔyine tan bata n yanfa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">alo baa igen na xara tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">alo baa wunle na xara.<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Xunbeli waxatin naɲanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">e findima nɛn fufaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">e rafe ige xunbenla nun ige dundun na.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Soge furen na, e xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">sogen na te, e xara xulɛn.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Yulane kiraan beɲinma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">siga na ige fendeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">e siga tonbonni, e faxa.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Tema kaa yulane igen fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">Saba kaa sigatiine tan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">ne laxi a ra a igen na yi.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Koni, e yagima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">bayo e bata e yigi sa na yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">e na na li, e sunuma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Ɛ luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">alo na igen tonbonni n tan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">Ɛ na n ma tɔrɔn to, ɛ gaxuma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>N bata ɛ maxɔdin kisena nde ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">N bata ɛ maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">a ɛ xa finmase yifuxina nde fi muxuna nde ma n xa ba?<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>N bata ɛ maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">a ɛ xa n ba yaxun yii ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">N bata ɛ maxɔdin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">a ɛ xa n xunba n ɲaxankata muxune yii ba?”<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Ɛ n xaran, nayi, n xa n dundu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">N naxan kalaxi, ɛ na fala n xa.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Fala faɲine mi muxun tɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">koni ɛ mafalane tɔnɔn nanse ra?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Ɛ waxi n ma falane nan matandi fe yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">alo yigitarena fala fuune.<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Ɛ muxu sifan susɛ masɛnsɛnna tiyɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">alogo ɛ xa kiridin sɔtɔ ɛ konyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">ɛ yi sa ɛ xɔyi kɛndɛn mati konyiyani!”<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>“Iki, ɛ yɛɛ ra findi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">n wulen falɛ ɛ yɛtagi ba?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Ɛ xɛtɛ na falan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">n bata ɛ mafan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">ɛ nama findi tinxintarene ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">Ɛ mɔn xa xɛtɛ, ɛ miri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">n ma tinxinyaan nan a bunna ra.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Tinxintareya falana n dɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">N mi nɔɛ fe ɲaxin kolonɲɛ ba?”<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi a tɔrɔna fe fala Ala xa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>“Adamadina dunuɲa yi gidin xɔdɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">alo sofa wanla ganli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">a siimayana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">alo karahan walikɛɛn gbeena,<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>alo konyina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">nininna xɔnla naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">alo walikɛɛn naxan a saren mamɛma.<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>Na kiini, n kɛɛn bata findi fuun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">n ma siimayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">kɔɛne yi rafe sɔxɔlɛne ra n tan xa.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>N na n sa, n yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">‘N kelima waxatin mundun yi?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Kɔɛɛn mi ɲanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">n lu n maxɛtɛ n ma saden ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">han xɔtɔnni.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Kunle nun bɛndɛna n fatin ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">alo dugina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">setene sɔxɔnma n fatin birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">a kun.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>N ma siimayaan mafura danguɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">dangu gɛsɛ sɔxɔnna kinaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">a danguma yigitɛgɛni.”<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>“Ala, a xa rabira i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">a n ma siimayaan mi buma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">n mi fa hɛrin toma n yɛɛn na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Yɛɛn naxan n matoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">na mi fa n toma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">i n fenma nɛn, koni n mi fa na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Kundaan naxan danguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">na ɲanma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">Na kiini, muxun naxan na siga laxira yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">na mi fa xɛtɛma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>A mi fa xɛtɛma a banxini sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">a konna mi fa a kolonma sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>“Nanara, n mi fa n dunduma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">n falan tima nɛn n niin ɲaxankatani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">N nan n mawugama nɛn n niin xɔlɛni.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Nanfera i kantan muxun dɔxi n xili ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">N tan magaxu ba, alo fufana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">hanma ige yi sube xaɲɛna nde?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>N na a falama, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">‘N sadena n masabarima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">n xiden yi n mali n ma mawugani suxɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>Nayi, i n magaxuma xiyene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">i n xibaruma kuisan feene nan ma.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>A yi rafanɲɛ n ma nun, n faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">Sayaan fisa n xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">benun n xa lu doyenɲɛ tun.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>N ma siimayaan bata raɲaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">n mi waxi a xɔn n xa lu n nii ra habadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">Nayi, xɛtɛ n fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">amasɔtɔ n ma siimayaan mi xunkuya.”<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>“Nanse adamadiin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">alogo i xa feni itoe birin liga a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">han i yi i yengi dɔxɔ a xɔn ma iki,<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>han i yi lu fɛ a xɔn xɔtɔn yo xɔtɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">i yi lu a fɛsɛfɛsɛ waxatin birin?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>I xun xanbi soma n yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">I a luma waxatin mundun yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">n yi n dɛgen nagerun?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Hali n bata yulubin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">n nɔɛ nanse ligɛ i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">i tan naxan adamadiine rakɔrɔsima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Nanfera i n yatɛxi se kala daxin na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">N goronna i tan xun ma di?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Nanfera i mi n ma matandine mafeluyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">i n hakɛne ba n ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Iki, n na n sama nɛn burunburunni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">i n fenma nɛn, n mi fa na.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Bilidadaa fala singena Yuba xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Suxa kaan Bilidada yi falan tongo, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Han waxatin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">i luyɛ i fala xuini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Han waxatin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">i fala xuine findɛ foye ɲaxin na?<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Alaa sariyan kalɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna tinxinna kalɛ ba?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>I ya diine yulubin liga nɛn a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">Ala yi e saran e murutɛ feene ra.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Koni, xa i tan Ala fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">xa i Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna maxandi,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>xa i sariɲan, xa i fanɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">a i malima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">a i raxɛtɛ i funfuni.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>I kii fonna mi yi sese ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">i kii nɛnɛn findima nɛn binye gbeen na.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Nayi, mayixɛtɛ danguxine maxɔdin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">i xaxili dɔxɔ e benbane xaxilimayaan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Amasɔtɔ, en barixi xoroni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">en mi sese kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">en ma siimayaan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">alo nininna.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Koni, e i xaranma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">e falan tima i xa e xaxilimayani.”<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>“Gbalan solɛ daraan xanbi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">Gbalan sabatɛ igen xanbi ba?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Hali a xindena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">a mi sɛgɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">a xarɛ sinma sɛxɛn bonne yɛɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">xa a mi igeni.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Na nan ligama muxune birin na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">naxanye ɲinanma Ala xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">Naxanye mi Ala kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">ne yigin ɲanma nɛn,<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>e yigin kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">alo simisamana yalana.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>A yigi sama a banxin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">koni a mi sensen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">a kankanxi a yiiseene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">koni e mi luma.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>A luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">alo wudi xinden sogen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">naxan a yiine yibandunma nakɔɔn xun ma.<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>A salenne godoxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">han e sa so gɛmɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">a sa gɛmɛn kuiin li.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Koni, xa a ba a tideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">mɛnna bɔxɔna a mɛma a ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">a naxa, ‘N tan munma i tan to.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>E sɛwan ɲanma na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">naxanye ɲinanma Ala xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">gbɛtɛye fan yi mini e funfuni.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>A mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">Ala mi sɔntaren nawolima ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">a mi fe ɲaxi rabane sɛnbɛ soma.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Ala i ragelema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">a yi sɛwan sa i yi.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>I yaxune yagima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">ɲaxudene yi ɲan.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Yuba yi a yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Ɲɔndin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">n na a kolon a na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">anu adamadiin nɔɛ tinxinɲɛ ayi di</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Ala yɛɛ ra yi?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Xa muxuna nde waxi Ala matandi feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">hali Ala a maxɔdin sanɲa ma wuli keden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">a mi a yabɛ hali keden pe.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Fekolonna nun sɛnbɛn birin a tan nan xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">Nde nɔɛ Ala matandɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">na feen mi saran a ra?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>A geyane bama e funfuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">a mi e rasogin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">a yi e raxuya ayi a xɔlɔni.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>A bɔxɔn naxuruxurunma a dɔxɔdeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">a yi bɔxɔn bunne raxuruxurun.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>A na falan ti sogen xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">sogen mi tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">a yi sarene ratagan dɛgɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>A tan nan keden koren daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">a sigan ti fɔxɔ igen mɔrɔnne fari.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.8</char> <char style="fk">Igen mɔrɔnne:</char> alo foyen na so igeni.</note><verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>A bata Kanko Gbee sare kurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">nun Donso sare kurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">nun Dii Tɛmɛ Solofere sare kurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">nun yiifari fɔxɔn sarene da.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> Mɛn kaane yi <char style="fk">sare kurune</char> yatɛxi nɛn alo se sawurane, e yi na sare kurune xili sa na seene xun ma. </note><verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>A fe gbeene ligama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">muxun mi naxan famunɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">a kabanako feene liga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">naxanye mi nɔɛ yatɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>A danguma n dɛxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">n mi a toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">A lɔma ayi, n mi a yigbɛma.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>A naxan xasunxi fangani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">nde nɔɛ na bɛ a yii?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Nde susɛ a maxɔdinɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">fa fala, ‘I nanse ligama?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Ala mi xɛtɛma a xɔlɔn fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">hali ige yi ninginangan Raxabi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">nun a walikɛne xinbi sinxi Ala bun ma.”<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>“Nayi, n tan nɔɛ a yabɛ nanse ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">N falan mundun tiyɛ a yɛtagi?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Hali n tinxin, n mi a yabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">n na n makiti muxun nan mafanma.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Hali n na a xili, a yi a ratin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">n mi lɛ a ra xa a tuli matiyɛ n xuiin na.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Amasɔtɔ a bata n halagi foye ɲaxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">a yi n ma fure dɛɛne rawuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">bun mi naxan ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>A mi tinma n yi yengi a faɲin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">koni a n nalugoma xɔlɛn nan na.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Nde sɛnbɛ gbo dangu birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">xa a tan mi a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Nde n xilima kiti sadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">xa a tan mi a ra?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Hali n yi tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">a n yalagima nɛn n ma falane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">Hali sɔntaren nan yi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">a yi n yitɛ sɔnmaan na.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>Sɔntaren nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">koni n mi fa n yɛtɛ yatɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">n bata n mɛ n niin na,<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>a birin keden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">nanara n na a falama fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">a Ala sɔntaren naxɔrima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">alo muxu ɲaxina.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Xa gbalon fa, a faxan ti sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">Ala sɔntarene tɔrɔyaan magelema nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>A dunuɲa sama muxu ɲaxine sagoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">a yi kitisane yɛɛne raxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Xa a tan mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">nde fa a ligɛ?”<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>“N ma siimayaan mafura danguɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">dangu gilaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">n ma lɔxɔne e gima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">n mi hɛrin toma,<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>e mafura alo kunki gbala daxina igeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">alo singbinna naxan sinma suben ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Xa n na a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">‘N xa ɲinan n ma mawugan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">n yi n ma sunun lu na, n yi n sɔbɛ so,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>n gaxuma nɛn n ma tɔrɔn birin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">bayo n na a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">a i mi n yatɛ sɔntaren na,<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>n kolonma tinxintaren nan na i yɛɛ ra yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">Nanfera n na n yɛtɛ xadanma fuuni?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Xa n na n maxa safunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">xa n na n yiine raxa libin na,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>i n nasinma nɛn lɔxɔn xɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">n yi raɲaxu n ma dugine yɛtɛɛn ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Muxu mi a tan na alo n tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">n mi nɔɛ a yabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">hanma nxu siga kiti sadeni.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Tagi yitɔn muxu mi nxu tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">naxan nɔɛ a yiin sɛ nxu firinna birin ma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.33</char> <char style="fk">Tagi yitɔn muxuna</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Yuba 16.19-21 nun Yuba 19.25 kui.</note><verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>naxan a dunganna bɛ n fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">alogo a nɔrɔn nama fa n magaxu.<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Nayi, n yi falan tima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">n mi gaxu a yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">Koni n bata a kolon a n kedenna na a ra.”<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba mɔn yi yabin ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">“N ma siimayaan bata raɲaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">n mi fa n ma mawugane danma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">n na n ma sɔxɔlɛn falama nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>N na a falama nɛn Ala xa, n naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">I nama n yalagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">a yita n na nanfera i xɔlɔxi n ma.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Ɲaxankatan findɛ fe faɲin na i tan xa ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">I yɛtɛ wali xɔnna rawolɛ ayi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">I yi muxu ɲaxine feene rasabati?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>I toon tima i muxu yɛɛne nan na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">i toon tima nɛn alo adamadiine ba?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>I ya siimayaan luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">alo adamadiine gbeen ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">I ya lɔxɔne luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">alo muxune gbeen ba?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>Nanfera i yi n hakɛne fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">i yi n yulubine xɔnfen?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Anu, i a kolon a muxu ɲaxi mi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">muxu yo mɔn mi nɔɛ n nakisɛ i yii.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>I tan nan n daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">i yiine yi n nafala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">koni iki, i waxi n naxɔri feni.<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>N ma fe xa rabira i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">a i n nafalaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">alo bɛndɛ yi sena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">i mɔn waxi n naxɛtɛ feen nin bɛndɛni ba?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>I n nafala nɛn nga fatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">alo nɔnɔn naxan findin fɛnɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>I yi fati bɛndɛn nun fati kidin sa n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">i yi n nafala xɔnne nun fasane ra.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>I mɔn yi siimayaan fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">i hinan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">i yi n niin nakantan.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Koni, i yi wundo feni ito luxunxi i bɔɲɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">n na i ya miriyani ito kolon,<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>fa fala xa n yulubin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">i nɔɛ n toɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">i mɔn mi diɲɛ n hakɛn ma.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Xa muxu ɲaxin nan n na nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">gbalona n xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Hali n tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">n mi nɔɛ n xunna rakelɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">n tan naxan nafexi yagin nun tɔrɔn na.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Xa n nan n xunna rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">i n kedima nɛn alo yatana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">i mɔn yi i ya kabanako feene ragodo n xili ma han!<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>I mɔn i ya gbalone rakelima n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">i ya xɔlɔn xun masama n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">i ya ganle biraxi e bode fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">n yɛngɛ xinla ma.”<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>“Nanfera i naminixi nga kuini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Hali n yi faxa nun, muxu yo mi n to,<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>n lu alo n mi da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">n ba nga kuini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">n sa maluxun gaburun na.<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>N ma lɔxɔne mi fa wuya sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">nayi, a lu, n xa sɛwa ndedi,<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>benun n xa siga yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">xɛtɛ mi dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">dɛnaxan nafexi dimin nun sayaan nininna ra,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>yamana yifɔrɛna alo dimina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">sayaan nininna nun kalan dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">kɛnɛnna luxi dɛnaxan yi alo dimina.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Sofara yi falan ti Yuba xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Nama kaan Sofara yi falan tongo, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Fala wuyaxini itoe yabi mi na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Falan nan tun yoon fima muxun ma ba?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Muxune dundɛ i ya fala ɲaxine bun ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">I magelen tiyɛ ba, muxe mi i rayagi?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>I a falama, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">‘N ma fekolonna sariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">fɛ yo mi n na Ala yɛtagi.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Koni, xa Ala yi waxi falan ti feni nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">xa a yi a dɛni biyɛ a falan ti i xa nun,<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>xa a yi a fekolonna wundone fala i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">naxanye fan xaxinla xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">nayi, i yi a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">a Ala mi i hakɛne birin saranxi i ra.”<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“I nɔɛ Ala miriyane kolonɲɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">I nɔɛ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna sɛnbɛn danna kolonɲɛ?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>A mate dangu kore xɔnna ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">I nanse ligɛ? A tilin laxira xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">I nanse famuma?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>A kuya dangu bɔxɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">a gbo dangu fɔxɔ ige baan na.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>Xa Ala fa muxune suxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">xa a e xili kiti sadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">nde nɔɛ a matandɛ?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Amasɔtɔ, Ala fuyantenne kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">a na hakɛn to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">a mi a yɛɛn naxiyɛ a ma.<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Koni, kɔmɔn mi nɔɛ findɛ xaxilimaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">alo sofali xuruxin to mi barɛ burunna ra.”<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>“I bɔɲɛn nafindi Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">i yiin ti a tan xa,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>i mɛ i hakɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">i nama tin tinxintareyaan yi so i konni.<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>Nayi, fɛ mi luma i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">i xunna kenla sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">i findi muxu kɛndɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">i mi fa gaxuma sese ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>I ɲinanma nɛn i ya sɔxɔlɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">i ɲinanma nɛn e xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">alo igen naxan danguma xude wunla ra.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>I ya siimayaan makɛnɛnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">alo yanyi tagina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">a dimin yi lu alo xɔtɔnna.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>I lannayaan sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">bayo i yigin sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">Ala i rakantanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">i lu bɔɲɛ xunbenli.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Muxu yo mi fa i raxulunɲɛ i ya xixɔnli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">muxu wuyaxi fama nɛn i xandideni.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Koni, ɲaxudene yɛɛn danxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">e yigin kalama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">e yengi fa tixi sayaan nan na.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi Sofara yabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Yuba yi a yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>“Ɲɔndin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">muxuyaan kolonna birin ɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">fekolonna ɲanma nɛn ɛ faxa xanbini.<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Koni, xaxilimayana nde n fan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">alo ɛ tan, ɛ mi dangu n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">nayi nde mi nɔɛ feni itoe birin kolonɲɛ?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>N bata findi magele seen na n xɔyine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">n tan naxan yi Ala maxandima, a yi n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">Muxu tinxinxi kamalixin bata findi magele seen na.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Ɛ tan, muxu hɛrixine tɔrɔ muxune raɲaxuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">na luxi nɛn alo muxun na salaxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">ɛ mɔn yi a radinɲɛ ayi.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbenla mafu tiine konne yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">naxanye Ala rafenma, ne makantanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">e e yɛtɛ sɛnbɛn nan yatɛxi e gbee ala ra.”<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>“Koni, subene maxɔdin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">e i xaranɲɛ nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">Xɔline maxɔdin kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">e a falɛ i xa nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Falan ti bɔxɔn na, a i xaranɲɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">yɛxɛne baani, e a falɛ i xa nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Ne birin yɛ, nde mi a kolon fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">naxan birin daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">a Alatala wanla nan na a ra?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Dali seene birin niine a tan nan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">e nun yengin naxan muxune birin yi.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Tunla falane tagi rabaan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">alo dɛɛn donseen ɲaxunna kolonma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Fekolonna fama foriyaan nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">xaxilimayaan fama simaya xunkuyen nan xɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>“Koni Ala nan gbee fekolonna nun sɛnbɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">Maxadin nun xaxilimayana a tan nan yii.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Ala na naxan kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">muxu yo mi na yitɔnɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">a na naxan sa kasoon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">muxu yo mi na xɔrɔyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Xa a mi tin tulen xa fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">furun yi ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">koni a na tulen beɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">bɔxɔn yi kala.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Sɛnbɛn nun kolonna a tan nan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">yanfantenne nun muxu yanfaxine birin a tan nan bun.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>A tan nan a ligama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">yamaan kawandi muxune yi sigan ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">e san yigenla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">a yi kitisane findi daxune ra.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>A tan nan mangane sɛnbɛn bama e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">a yi kasorasa dugin nagodo e ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>A tan nan saraxaraline fan nasigama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">e san yigenla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">a yi nɔya kɛndɛne kala.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>A tan nan falan bama fala tiine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">a yi xaxilimayaan ba fonne yi.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>A tan nan tɔrɔn nafama kuntigine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">a yi sɛnbɛmane sɛnbɛn kala.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>A tan nan dimi yi feene raminin kɛnɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">naxanye yi laxira yi, a yi ne makɛnɛn.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>A tan nan siyane rawuyama ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">a yi e raxɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">A siyane ragbo ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">a yi e raxuya ayi.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>A xaxinla ba yamaan kuntigine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">a yi e rabeɲin tonbonni kira mi dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>E lu dimini kɛnɛn mi dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">a yi e xun magi e ra alo dɔlɔ minna.”<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi wa falan ti feni Ala xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">“A mato, n yɛɛn bata na birin to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">n tunla bata na birin mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">n yi a famu.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Ɛ naxan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">n fan na kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">ɛ mi dangu n na.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Koni, n tan waxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">falan ti feni Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">n waxi n xa n mawuga Ala xa.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Koni ɛ tan wulen nan tun sama ɲɔndin yɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">ɛ birin findixi dandan ti fuyanne nan na.<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Xa ɛ yi ɛ dundɛ nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">na yi findɛ ɛ fekolonna ra nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Ɛ n ma mawugan namɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">ɛ tuli mati n ma mawuga xuiin na.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Ala makoon luyɛ ɛ tinxintareyaan ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">ɛ wulene fala Ala mali feen na?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Ɛ waxi ɛ sa feni Ala nan fari n xili ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Ɛ Ala nan xun mafalama ba?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>A na ɛ miriyane yatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">na fanɲɛ ɛ ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Ɛ nɔɛ a yanfɛ ba alo muxuna?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Ɲɔndin naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">ɛ na kitin sa yɛtagin ma hali wundoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">Ala falan tima nɛn ɛ xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Ɛ mi gaxuma a binyen yɛɛ ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">A magaxun mi ɛ suxɛ ba?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Ɛ sandane luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">alo xubena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">ɛ xun mafala falane kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">alo bɛndɛna.”<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>“Ɛ dundu, ɛ n lu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">N xa falan ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">hali sese n sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Nanfera n nan n fati bɛndɛn xinɲɛ n ɲinne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">nanfera n tinɲɛ sayaan ma?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Xa Ala wa, a xa n faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">n yengi mi fa sese ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">koni n waxi n sigati kiin xɔnba feni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">a tan nan yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Na yɛtɛɛn findima n ma kisin nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">bayo Ala kolontare yo mi tima a yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Ɛ tuli mati n ma falan na a faɲin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">n ma fe yɛ xaranna xa so ɛ tunla ma.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>N bata n xun mafala feni tɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">n na a kolon a ɲɔndina n tan nan xa.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Nde waxi n xun maxidi feni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Nayi, xa ɲɔndi mi n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">n tinxi n yi n dundu, n faxa.”<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>“N ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">fe firin gbansan masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">nayi, n mi luxunɲɛ i ma:<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>I ya xɔlɔn masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">i ya magaxun nama fa n suxu sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Na xanbi ra, falan ti n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">n ni i yabɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">hanma n yi falan ti, i yi n yabi.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Yoli n hakɛne nun n yulubine yatɛn na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">N ma murutɛ feene nun n ma yulubine yita n na.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Nanfera i yɛtagin luxunma n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">i yi n yatɛ i yaxun na?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>I n tan nan magaxuma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">n tan naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">alo ɲɔxɔndena foyen sigan naxan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">I n tan nan sagatanma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">n tan naxan luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">alo malo dagi xarena?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>I fe xɔlɛne sɛbɛma n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">i n ma dii ɲɔrɛyaan hakɛn goronna dɔxɔ n xun ma.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>I n sanne sama kutun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">i yɛɛn tixi n sigati kiin birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">hali n san funfune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">i e birin nakɔrɔsima.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>Koni, adamadiine kunma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">alo wudi kalaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">alo xiine dugin kala kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba mɔn yi yabin ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">“Adamadiin minixi ɲaxanla nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">a siimayaan mi xunkuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">a rafexi lanbaranna nan na,<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>a luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">alo wudi fugen naxan minima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">a xara, alo nininna, a mi buma.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>N ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">i yɛɛn tima n tan nan na ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">naxan luxi alo adamadiin bodene?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">I kitin nasoma en tan nan tagi ba?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Nde nɔɛ se sariɲanxin bɛ se haramuxini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Muxu yo.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>I bata muxuna siimayaan danna ragidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">i yi a siimayaan kikene yatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">a mi danguɛ naxanye ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">i naxanye saxi.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Nanara, i yɛɛn ba muxun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">a xa a matabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">alogo a xa a waxatin naɲan bɔɲɛ xunbenli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">alo walikɛɛn yanyin naɲanma kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>“Yigin wudin tan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">bayo a na sɛgɛ, a mɔn yi mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">a ɲɔxɔn mi ɲanma,<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>hali a salenna fori bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">a xun dungin yi faxa bɔxɔni,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>igen nɛɛn fa sa a ma tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">a mɔn bata a mabun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">a yi a ɲingine ramini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">alo a yi kii naxan yi a fɔlɔni.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Koni, xa muxun faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">a sɛnbɛn bata ɲan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">Muxun na faxa, a sigan minɛn?<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Igen ɲanma nɛn baani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">xudene yi xara.<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>Muxun na faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">a ɲanma na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">a mi fa kelima sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">fanni kore xɔnna na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">a mi xulunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">a mi kelima a xixɔnli.”<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>“Xa i yi tinɲɛ n luxunɲɛ laxira yi nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">n yi lu na han i ya xɔlɔn yi ɲan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">I mɔn yi waxatin nagidi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">n ma fe rabirama i ma waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Koni muxun naxan bata faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">na mɔn kelɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">N diɲama nɛn n ma wali waxatin bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">han i fa n naxulunma waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Nayi, n ni i yabɛ, i na n xili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">i na wa n to feni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">i tan naxan n daxi.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Anu iki, i n sigati kiin birin yatɛxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">Koni na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">i mi fa n yulubine yatɛma,<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>i n ma murutɛ feene luxunma nɛn bɛnbɛnla kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">i yi n hakɛne mafelu.”<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>“Koni, hali geyane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">nde luma bɛ e ra waxatin birin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">han e xuya ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">hali fanyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">e bama e funfuni a xunxuri yɛɛn ma,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>igen luma nde bɛ gɛmɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">baa walanxine yi bɔxɔn tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">i fan adamadiine yigin kalama na kii nin.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>I muxune yɛngɛma habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">e yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">i yi e yɛtagin masara, i yi e kedi.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Xa binyena e diine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">e mi na kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">Xa e rayarabi, e mi na yigbɛma.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>A tan nan tun a tɔrɔn kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">a sunuxi a yɛtɛ nan tun ma fe ra.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi a falan firindena: Ala ɲaxudene saranma nɛn e kɛwanle ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Teman kaana Elifasi mɔn yi falan tongo, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Fekolonna lan a yi yabin ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">naxan tɔnɔ mi na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">naxan findixi fala fuun na?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>I lan i yi i xun mafala fala buntarene ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">naxanye tɔnɔ mi na?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>I Ala yɛɛragaxun kalama muxune yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">i e Ala maxandi feene xunna kalama.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>I i hakɛne nan ma fe falama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">Fala ɲaxine nan i dɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>N tan mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">i fala xuiin nan i yalagixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">I dɛɛn nan i seren na.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>I singe nan barixi adamadiine birin yɛɛ ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">I singe nan daxi benun geyane xa da ba?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>I Ala wundo falane ramɛ nɛn ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">I tan nan keden fe kolon ba?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>I nanse kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">nxu mi naxan kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">I nanse famuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">nxu mi naxan famuma?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Xun sɛxɛ fixɛne na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">fonne nxu yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">naxanye fori i fafe xa.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Ala i ralimaniyama falan naxanye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">i makoon mi ne ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">nxu fala faɲin naxanye tima?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Nanfera i bɔɲɛn tema?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">Nanfera i yɛɛn xun sinma,<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>i niin nafɔrɔ Ala xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">i na fala sifane ti?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>Nanse adamadiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">a yi a yɛtɛ yatɛ sariɲanden na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Naxan minixi ɲaxanli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">na findɛ tinxinden na ba?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Hali a malekane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">Ala mi lannayaan saxi ne yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">Hali kore xɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">a mi sariɲan a yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>A xa lannayaan sa muxun tan yi di nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">naxan ɲaxu, naxan yanfan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">tinxintareyaan nafan naxan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">alo igen min daxina?”<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“N xa a yɛba i xa, i tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">N xa a yɛba n naxan toxi,<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>fekolonne naxan falaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">e nun e benbane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">naxanye mi sese luxunxi e ma,<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Ala yamanan so naxanye gbansan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">xɔɲɛ yo munma yi so naxanye yɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>“Ɲaxuden luma kɔntɔfinla nin a siimayaan birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">ɲaxankata tiina waxatin yatɛxin na a ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>A wurundun xui magaxuxine mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">bɔɲɛ xunbeli waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">halagin yi fa a tan ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>A mi laxi a mini feen na sɔnɔn dimini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">a faxama yɛngɛn nin.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>A donseen fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">koni a sɔtɛ minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">A kolon a faxan lɔxɔna a mamɛma.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Kɔntɔfili feene nun kuisan feene a magaxuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">e wuyaxi yi fa a xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">alo mangana ganla nan sigan yɛngɛni.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Ne feene birin a sɔtɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">bayo a bata susu Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">a murutɛ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>A keli nɛn Ala xili ma a tengbesenyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">a yɛ masansan wure lefa gbeen tixi a yɛɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>A yɛtagin tuyanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">a gbingin gbo,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>koni a luma nɛn taa rabeɲinxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">banxi kui genle yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">naxanye kalamatɔ a ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Na kanna mi fa hɛrin sɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">a nafunla mi sabatima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">a fɔxɔn mi fa luma bɔxɔn fari sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>A mi tangama sayaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">a luma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">alo tɛɛn wudi dungin naxan ganma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Ala dɛ foyen yi a xali wulani.”<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>“A yigin saxi fuyanten feene nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">koni a yɛtɛ nan yanfanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">bayo fuyantenyaan nan findima a saranna ra.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Na kamalima nɛn benun a xa faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">alo wudin naxan mi fa a maɲingima.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>A luxi nɛn alo manpa binla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">naxan a bogine rayolonma e mɔn xinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">hanma alo oliwi binla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">naxan fugeye yolonma a ra.”<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>“Na ligama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">bayo dii mi barima Ala kolontarene denbayane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">yanfan banxin naxanye kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">ne findima tɛɛn balon nan na.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Sɔxɔlɛ feene e yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">na yi findi fe ɲaxine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">e yanfani tɔn e bɔɲɛni.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabina: Sereyana nde n xa kore xɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Yuba yi a yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“N bata fala sifani ito mɛ dɔxɔ wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">ɛ birin findixi madɛndɛn ti ɲaxine nan na.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Danna fuyanten falani itoe ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Nanse ɛ tɔrɔma ɛ to n yabima na kiini?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>N fan yi nɔɛ falan tiyɛ nɛn alo ɛ tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">xa ɛ tan nan yi n tan na nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">Nayi, n yi falane tima nɛn ɛ xili ma nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">n yi n xunni maxa ɛ magele xinla ma,<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>n yi ɛ sɛnbɛ soma nɛn n ma falane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">n yi ɛ madɛndɛn ɛ tɔrɔni n ma fala faɲine xɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Koni, n ma falane mi nɔɛ n tan madɛndɛnɲɛ n ma tɔrɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">Xa n na n dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">na fan mi se bɛ n ma tɔrɔn na.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Iki, Ala bata n sɛnbɛn ɲan yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">A bata n ma denbayaan birin halagi.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>A bata n fatin mafasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na yi findi sereyaan na n xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">A to n naxɔsixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na yi findi n magi xunna ra.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Ala n yibɔma a xɔlɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">a n yɛngɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">a ɲinne raxinma n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">n yɛngɛ faan yi a yɛɛ ɲaxin ti n na.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Muxune e dɛni bima n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">e n konbi, e n dɛɛn bɔnbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">e malan n xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Ala bata n so tinxintarene yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">a bata n so ɲaxudene yii.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>N yi bɔɲɛ xunbenla nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">Ala bata fa n kaladeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">A bata n suxu n xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">a n nabira bɔxɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">A bata n lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">alo xalimakunla sa sɔtima seen naxan yi,<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>a xalimakuli wonle bata n nabilin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Ala n sɔxɔnma n gbingini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">a mi kininkininma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">a n bɔɲɛn sa bɔxɔni.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>A fama n xili ma alo sofana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">a n ɲaxankata, a lu n maxɔlɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>“N bata kasa bɛnbɛli dugin nagodo n ma sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">n mi naxan bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">n lu xun sinxi burunburunni.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Wugan bata n yɛɛn gbeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">sayaan singanxi n yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Anu, n mi fe ɲaxi yo ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">n ma Ala maxandin yi sariɲan.”<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>“I tan Bɔxɔna, n faxamatɔɔn ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">i nama n wunla yɛ maluxun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">N wuga xuiin xa mɛ han habadan.<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Iki yɛtɛni, serena nde n xa kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">naxan seren bama n xa mɛnni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.19</char> Na <char style="fk">serena</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Yuba 19.25 nun Yuba 9.33 kui.</note><verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>N xɔyine n magelema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">koni n yɛɛn tixi Ala nan na n ma wugani.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Na kanna Ala solonama muxun xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">alo adamadina a xɔyin xun mafalama kii naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>Koni, n ma siimayaan bata a danna li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">n sigama nɛn kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">xɛtɛ mi dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yigin yi kala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">“N yengin dasama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">n ma siimayaan yi ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">gaburun dɔxi n yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Magele tiine n nabilinni yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">e fa fuma n ma, n mi nɔɛ xiyɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>“Ala, i bata tolimaan naxan maxɔdin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">i yɛtɛɛn xa na so n yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">Xa i tan mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">nde gbɛtɛ n ma donla goronna tongɛ?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Bayo i bata xaxinla birin ba n xɔyine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">na ma, i nama tin e xa nɔɔn sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>E luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">alo muxun naxan yanfan soma a xɔyine xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">na yi findi tɔrɔn na a diine xa.”<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>“Muxune n magelema e sigine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">e dɛgen namini n yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>N yɛɛne bata yidimi sununi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">n fati bɛndɛn bata yelefu ayi alo a nininna.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Muxu faɲine na n to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">n kiin yi e ratɛrɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">sɔntarene xɔlɔma n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">e yi n yatɛ Ala kolontaren na.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Koni, tinxin muxune xa lu e kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">naxanye sariɲan, ne sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>Koni ɛ tan, ɛ xɛtɛ, ɛ mɔn xa fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">N mi fekolon toma ɛ yɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>N ma siimayaan bata ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">n ma wanle bata kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">n waxɔn feene bata kala.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>N xɔyine a falama, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">a kɔɛɛn findima nɛn a yanyin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">fitirin na so, e fala a subaxan na a ra.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>N xa n yigi sa laxira yi tun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">n na n sama dimini dɛnaxan yi?<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>N falan tima nɛn n gaburun xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">alo a tan nan n fafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">N falan ti kunle xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">alo e tan nan nga nun n magilɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Nayi, n yigin minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Nde n yigin toɛ?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Yigin laxira yi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">nxu birin na siga nxu sa nxu sa burunburunni?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s">Bilidadaa falan firindena: Fe ɲaxi rabane saranna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Suxa kaan Bilidada mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“I falan danma waxatin mundun yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Xaxili fen, na xanbi ra, en falan tiyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Nanfera i nxu yatɛxi xuruseene ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">Nanfera i nxu mirixi xaxilitarene ra?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Yuba, i tan nan i yɛtɛ maxɔlɔxi i ya xɔlɔni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">I laxi a ra a muxune dunuɲa rabeɲinma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">i tan ma fe ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Fanyen xa keli a dɔxɔdeni i ya fe ra ba?”<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>“Ɲaxudena tɛɛ dɛgɛn tuma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">a tanden yalanna yi ɲan.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Kɛnɛnna yi findi dimin na a konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">a lɛnpun yi tu a xun ma.”<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>“A madiganma nɛn a sigatiin sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">a feene a rabirama nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>A sanne suxuma nɛn yalaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">a sin yinla ra.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>A suxuma a san tinban nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">gbatun yi a suxu.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Lutin natixi a yɛɛ ra bɔxɔn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">wosona a kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Gaxun luma ayi nɛn yiren birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">a bira a san funfun fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>“A tan naxan sɛnbɛ yi gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">a sɛnbɛn bata ɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">gbalon bata maso a ra.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Furen bata a fati kidin kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">saya furen bata a salen seene kun a ma.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Sayaan bata a suxu a konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">a yigi saxi dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">a yi a xali manga magaxuxin fɛma.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Muxu gbɛtɛ nɔɛ dɔxɛ nɛn a konni sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">a gbee mi fa a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">seri fuɲin bata sa a konna birin ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">18.15 </char>Na <char style="fk">seri fuɲin</char> sama faxa muxun konna ma nɛn alogo na xa rasariɲan.</note><verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>A bata lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">alo wudin salenne na xara a bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">a dɛɛne yi xara a ma.”<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>“A funfun birin bata ɲan bɔxɔn fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">a xinla mi fa falama kiraan xɔn sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>A bata radin dimini keli kɛnɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">a yi ɲan dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Dii yo mi a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">mayixɛtɛ yo mi a xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">muxu yo mi fa a konni sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Muxun naxanye sogeteden binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">ne kabɛma nɛn a raɲanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">muxun naxanye sogegododen binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">gaxun yi ne suxu.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Tinxintarena denbayaan luma na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">Ala kolontaren nan kon na ra.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi Bilidada yabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Yuba yi a yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>“Ɛ luma n ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">han waxatin mundun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">ɛ n sɔxɔlɛ ɛ falane ra?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Ɛ bata n konbi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">han sanɲa ma fu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">ɛ mi yagɛ n tɔrɛ sɔnɔn ba?<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Hali n bata tantan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">n ma tantanna goronna luma n tan nan xun ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Xa ɛ ɛ yɛtɛ yite n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">ɛ yi n mafala n yagi feen na,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>nayi, ɛ xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">a Ala nan tɔrɔni ito ragidixi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">a n mafilin a yalani.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Xa n gbelegbele tɔrɔni ito bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">n mi yabi sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">N na xinla ti n mali feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">kiti kɛndɛn mi sɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Ala bata kiraan suxu n yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">n mi nɔɛ danguɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">a yi dimin naso n ma kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>A bata n ma binyen ba n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">a yi n ma xunna kenla ba n yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">naxan yi luxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">alo manga kɔmɔtina n xa.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>A bata n kala yiren birin yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">n naxɔrima nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">A bata n yigin kala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">alo wudin talaxina.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>A bata xɔlɔ n xili ma han,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">a yi n yatɛ a yaxun na.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>A yɛngɛsone bata e malan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">e fa n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">e yi n konna rabilin.”<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>“A bata ngaxakedenne masiga n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">naxanye n kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">ne bata siga ayi pon.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>N kon kaane bata n nabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">n lanfane yi ɲinan n xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>N ma muxune</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">nun n ma walikɛ ɲaxanle birin n yatɛxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">alo xɔɲɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">n bata findi xɔɲɛn na e yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>N na n ma walikɛɛn xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">koni a mi n yabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">hali n na a mafan.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>N ma ɲaxanla mi fa tinɲɛ n dɛɛn xirin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">n ma fe bata raɲaxu n ma denbayaan ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Hali dii ɲɔrɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">n naɲaxu e birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">n na keli, e n mafala.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>N naɲaxu n xɔyi kɛndɛne birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">hali naxanye rafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">ne bata e xun xanbi so n yii.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>N bata doyen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">n kidin nun n xɔnne nan gbansan fan n ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>N xɔyine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">ɛ kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">ɛ kininkinin n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">bayo Ala sɛnbɛn bata n ɲaxankata!<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Nanfera ɛ n sagatanma alo Ala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Ɛ munma wasa n ɲaxankatadeni ba?”<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“N yi waxi a xɔn ma nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">n ma falane yi sɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">e yi sa kɛdini,<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>e yi sɛbɛ yɔxɔ lefaan ma wure ɲɔɛ ralemunxin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">e yi kɛrɛndɛn fanyen ma han habadan!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>N na a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">a n xunbamana a nii ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">Dɔnxɛn na, a kelima nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">a ti bɔxɔ xɔnna ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.25</char> Na <char style="fk">xunbamana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Yuba 9.33 nun 16.19-21 kui.</note><verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Hali n fati kidin birin na kun fureni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">n gbindin sa Ala toma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>N na a toma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">n na a tan nan toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">gbɛtɛ mi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">N kunfaxi na waxatin xɔn!<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>Ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">‘En na a sagatanma di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">En fa fɛɛn mundun toma a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">a yalagi xunna ra?’<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>Anu, ɛ yi lan nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">ɛ gaxu silanfanna yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">amasɔtɔ Ala ɛ saranma nɛn ɛ ɲaxankatane ra sayaan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">Nayi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn a Ala kitin na.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s">Sofaraa yabin firindena: Ɲaxudene xunna kenla mi buma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Nama kaan Sofara mɔn yi a fala, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>“N xaminxi ɛ miriyane fe yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">na nan n karahanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">n xa yabin ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">n mi fa nɔɛ diɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>N bata n konbi xuine mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">koni, n yabin tima nɛn xaxilimayani.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>I mi a kolon ba, waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">xabu adamadiine lu bɔxɔn fari,<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>a ɲaxudene xunna kenla mi buma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">a Ala kolontarene sɛwan ɲanma nɛn mafurɛn?<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Hali a te han kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">hali a xunna sa so kundani,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>a lɔma ayi nɛn habadan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">alo a gbiina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">Naxanye yi a toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">ne a falama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">‘A minɛn?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>A danguma nɛn alo xiyena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">a funfun yi lɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">a ɲanma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">alo xiyen kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Muxun naxan yi a matoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">na mi fa a matoma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">hali a dɔxɔden mi fa a toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>A diine karahanxin yi yiigelitɔne yii raxɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">e tan yɛtɛɛn yi a nafunle raxɛtɛ na muxune ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Hali a siimayaan to munma yi xunkuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">a yi sa a gaburun na.”<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Fe ɲaxin ɲaxun a dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">alo sukana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">a naxan luxunma a lɛnna bun,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>a naxan madunxunma a dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">a mi waxi naxan xa ɲan,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>koni a donseen kunma nɛn a kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">a findi fɔdɔgɔɔn xɔlɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>A bata nafunle magerun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">koni a e baxunma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Ala e raminima nɛn a kui.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>A yi fɔdɔgɔɔn xɔlɛn nan madunxunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">saɲin xɔlɛn nan a faxama.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Kumin nun nɔnɔn gbo yamanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">alo baa igena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">koni a mi fa na toma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>A tɔnɔn naxan sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">a na raxɛtɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">a mi a donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">a mi fa a yulaya seene tɔnɔn sɔtɔma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Na birin ligama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">bayo a yiigelitɔne ɲaxankata nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">a yi e rabeɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">a yi banxina nde tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">a mi naxan tixi.”<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“A mi yi wasama a kunfani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">nanara, a nafunla sese mi yi luma.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Muxu yo mi tangama a kunfan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">koni a hɛrin mi buma.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>A kɔntɔfilima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">hali a hɛrini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">tɔrɔyaan sifan birin yi fa a ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>A na a kuiin nafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">Ala a xɔlɔn nafama nɛn a xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">a godoma nɛn a ma alo tulena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">a findi a balon na.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Xa a gi wure silanfanna bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">xalimakuli sula daxin nan sa a yisɔxɔnma.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>A xalimakunla botinma nɛn a fatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">naxan ɲɔɛ bata sa a bɔɲɛn sɔxɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">koni sayaan magaxuna a suxuma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>A nafulu ramaraden nafema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">dimi gbeen nan tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">Tɛɛn yi fa a halagideni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">muxe mi naxan nadɛgɛxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">muxun naxanye mɔn na lu a konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">tɛɛn yi ne fan gan.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Kore xɔnna a hakɛne raminima nɛn kɛnɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">bɔxɔ xɔnna yi keli a xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>A nafunle yi makuyama a ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">Ala na a xɔlɔn nagodo a xili ma lɔxɔn naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Ala fe ɲaxi rabane raɲanma na kii nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">Ala na nan findixi a kɛɛn na.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi Sofara yabi: Nanfera ɲaxudene hɛrini?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>“Ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">ɛ tuli mati n ma falan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">ɛ n nalimaniyama na kiini.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Ɛ tin n xa falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">n na falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">nayi, ɛ nɔɛ n magelɛ nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>N na n mawugama adamadiine nan xɔn ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Ɛn-ɛn de! Nanfera nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">ɛ waxi a xɔn a n xa diɲa?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Ɛ na ɛ miri n ma fe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">ɛ kabɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">ɛ yi ɛ yiin sa ɛ dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">ɛ yi ɛ dundu.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Feen naxan birin n sɔtɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">n na n miri ne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">n kuisanma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">n fatin yi xuruxurun n ma.”<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>“Nanfera ɲaxudene mɔn e nii ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">Nanfera e siimayaan buma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">Nanfera e sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>E yi e yixɛtɛne to sabatɛ e dɛxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">e yi e mamandenne to.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Feene birin lanxi e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">e mi gaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">Ala mi e ratɔrɔnma.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>E turane e ɲinge gilɛne rawuyama ayi waxatin birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">e ɲingene diine barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">e mi faxama.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>E diine e gima na xun xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">alo xuruse diine, e yi e bodon.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>E sigin sama kondenna nun tanban xuini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">xulen xuiin nafan e ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>E na e siimayani dangu a faɲin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">e siga laxira yi bɔɲɛ xunbenli.”<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>“Anu, e a falama Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">e naxa, ‘I masiga nxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">nxu mi waxi i ya kirane kolon feni.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>A lan nxu yi findi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna konyine ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Ala mafanna tɔnɔn findɛ nanse ra nxu xa?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>E laxi a ra a hɛrin kanna e tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">koni, e fe yitɔnxine raɲaxu n ma.”<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Ɛ bata ɲaxudene lɛnpun to tuyɛ sanɲa ma yoli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Ɛ bata e to gbaloni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Ɛ bata Ala to e ratɔrɔnɲɛ a xɔlɔni ba?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>E luxi nɛn ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">alo foyen sɛxɛn naxan xalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">alo wuluwunla xuben naxan yitema?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Ɛ a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">‘Ala ɲaxudene hakɛne saranna ramaraxi e diine nan xa.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Koni, e hakɛne yi lan a xa saran e yɛtɛɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">alogo e xa a kolon.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>A yi lan e yɛtɛɛn yi e halagin to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">e yi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna xɔlɛn min.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>A denbayaan bɔtɛ mundun fa a tan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">a faxa xanbini?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>Nde nɔɛ Ala xaranɲɛ fe kolonna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">a tan naxan malekane makitima?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Muxuna nde faxama hɛri gbeen nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">kɔntɔfili yo mi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">a bɔɲɛn xunbelixi,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>a tuyanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">sɛnbɛn mɔn a ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Muxu gbɛtɛ bɔɲɛn sunuxin yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">a mi fe faɲi yo sɔtɔ hali keden pe.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Koni, e firinna birin sama bɛndɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">kunle yi e don.”<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“N bata ɛ miriyane kolon ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">ɛ feen naxanye yitɔnxi n xili ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Ɛ a falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">ɛ naxa, ‘Muxu gbeeni ito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">a banxin minɛn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Ɲaxuden konna go?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">E mi fa na.’<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Koni, ɛ mi dangu muxune maxɔdinxi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Ɛ mi laxi e sereyaan na ba?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Gbalon na fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">fe ɲaxi rabane yi kisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">Alaa xɔlɔn na fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">a mi sese ligama e tan na.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Nde e raxɔlɛ e fe raba kiin ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Nde e saren fiyɛ e kɛwanle ra?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>E na e maluxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">muxune yi e yengi dɔxɔ e gaburune xɔn,<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>mɛrɛmɛrɛn bɛndɛ yelefuxine yi sa e fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">Dunuɲa muxune birin birama nɛn e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">gali gbeen yi siga e yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>Nanfera nayi ɛ n masabarima fala fuune ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Yanfa falane nan tun ɛ yabine ra.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s">Elifasi a falan saxanden Yuba xa: Hakɛ kanna nan Yuba ra yati!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Teman kaana Elifasi mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Adamadiin tɔnɔna Ala ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Hali xaxilimana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">a tɔnɔn luma a yɛtɛ nan tun ma.<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>I na tinxinɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">na tɔnɔna Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Xa fɛ mi i sigati kiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">na munanfanna a ma ba?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>I mirixi a ma ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">a Ala i ratɔrɔnma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">a i xali kiti sadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">i to gaxuxi a yɛɛ ra?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>I ya fe ɲaxine mi gbo ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">I hakɛne dan mi na.<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>I yi tolimaan tongoma i ngaxakedenne yii fuun nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">i yi e dugine ba e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">i yi e magenla lu.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>I mi yi igen soma muxun yii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">min xɔnla naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">i yi tondi donseen soɛ kamɛtɔɔn yii.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Yamanan yi sɛnbɛmaan nan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">wasoden nan yi dɔxi yamanani.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>I yi kaɲa gilɛne raxɛtɛma nɛn e yii genla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">i yi kiridine ɲaxankata.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Nanara, i rabilinxi luti ratixine ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">gaxun yi i suxu xulɛn.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Nayi, i mi dimini ito toma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">i mi fufani ito toma ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">naxan i rabilinxi?”<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“Ala mi kore xɔnna xan ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Sarene mato kore, e mate pon!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>I a falama, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">‘Ala nanse kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">A nɔɛ kitin sɛ kunda dimin xanbi ra ba?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Kundana a yɛɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">a mi sese toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">a nɛma kore xɔnna rabilinɲɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>I mɔn waxi lu feni kira fonni ito xɔn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">muxu ɲaxine sigan tima naxan xɔn?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>E faxan nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">benun e waxatin xa li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">alo fufa gbeen banxi kanken xalima kii naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>E yi a falama nɛn Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">e naxa, ‘I masiga nxu ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">koni i nɔɛ nanse ligɛ nxu ra?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Anu, Ala nan e banxine rafe nafunla ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">Ee! Ɲaxudene fe yitɔnxine raɲaxu n ma!<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Tinxindene na e to gbaloni, e sɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">Sɔntarene e magelema nɛn, e naxa,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘En yaxune bata raxɔri!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">Tɛɛn yi e yiiseene halagi.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Lanna xa lu ɛ nun Ala tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">nayi, i bɔɲɛ xunbenla sɔtɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">i hɛrin sɔtɔ.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Ala i xaranma naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">i na suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">i yi a falane sa i bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Xa i mɔn fa Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">a mɔn i sɛnbɛ soma nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">I xa tinxintareyaan masiga i konna ra,<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>i xa i ya xɛma faɲin woli ayi bɔxɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">hanma i sa a bira xude yi gɛmɛne longonna ra.<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan xa findi i ya nafunla ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">alo xɛmaan nun gbeti fixɛ gbeena i xa.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Nayi, i sɛwan sɔtɔma nɛn Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">i xunna kenla sɔtɔ Ala yɛtagi,<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>i yi a maxandi, a yi i yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">i yi i dɛ ti xuine rakamali.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Xa i fena nde ragidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">Ala a rakamalima nɛn i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">kɛnɛnna luma nɛn i ya kiraan birin xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Ala na muxuna nde rayagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">i a falama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">a Ala na ligaxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">bayo wasoden nan na kanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">koni, naxan na a yɛtɛ magodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">Ala na rakisima nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Ala nan sɔntarene xunbama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">nanara, xa i sariɲan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">a i xunbama nɛn.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabina Elifasi xa: Yuba mi fa Ala toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>“N ma mawugan mɔn findixi murutɛn nan na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">n yiin saxi n dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">koni n wuga xuiin mɔn minima.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Xa n yi a kolon nun Ala dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">n yi sigama nɛn han a konni,<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>n yi n ma mawugan yita a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">n yi n xɔnba fala wuyaxi ti a xa.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Nayi, n yi a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">a n yabima falan naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">n yi a famu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">a naxan falama n xa.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>A yi kelɛ n xili ma a sɛnbɛ gbeeni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Ɛn-ɛn de, a yi a tuli matima nɛn n na.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>A yi a kolonma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">a muxu faɲin nan falan tima a xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Nayi, n yi tangama nɛn kitin ma habadan.”<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>“Koni, n na siga sogeteden binni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">a mi na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">n mi a toma sogegododen binni,<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>n na a fen n kɔmɛnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">n mi a toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">n na xɛtɛ n yiifanna mabinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">n mi a toma.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Anu, a n ma kiraan kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">A na n fɛsɛfɛsɛ tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">n sariɲanxin minima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">alo xɛmana.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>N biraxi a san funfun nan tun fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">n lu a kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">n mi keli a xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>N mi tondi a yamarine suxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">n na a falane birin namara nɛn n bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>Koni, a na fena nde ragidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">nde a ligɛ a na masara?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">A na wa naxan xɔn, a na liga.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>A naxan nagidixi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">a na nan nakamalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">anu a mɔn na fe sifa wuyaxin nagidixi n ma yɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Nanara, n gaxuma Ala yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">N na n miri, n gaxu a fe yi.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Ala bata n tunnaxɔlɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna bata n nafe gaxun na.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Koni hali dimin to so n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">a yi n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">hali n mi fa sese toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">n mi n dundu.”<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba mɔn yi falan ti: Nanfera Ala mi ɲaxudene makitima?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>“Nanfera Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna mi kiti waxatine saxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Nanfera naxanye a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">ne mi a toma kelɛ muxu ɲaxine xili ma?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Muxu ɲaxine xɛ bɔxɔne danne fari sama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">e xuruseene muɲama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">e yi e raba,<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>e kiridin nan ma sofali suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">e kaɲa gilɛn nan ma ɲinge makankanma tolimani,<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>e tɔrɔ muxune radinma ayi kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">yamanan yiigelitɔne birin e luxunma e bun.”<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>“Yiigelitɔne sigama e wanla ra nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">e sa e donseen fen burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">e sa e diine balon fen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">alo burunna sofanle tonbonni.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>E sa e xuruseene balon fen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">muxu gbɛtɛye xɛɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">e lu ɲaxudene manpa bogi dɔnxɛne makentunɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>E ragenle nan xima kɔɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">dugi mi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">bitingan mi e yii xunbenla ra.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Tulen naxan fama geyane fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">na e bɔnbɔma xunbenli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">banxi mi e yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">e saxi fanyene nan ma.”<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>“Muxu ɲaxine yiigelitɔna diin tongoma a yii doli saranna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">hali kiridina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">e xasunma xiɲɛn na a nga yii.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Yiigelitɔne ragenla nan sigama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">dugi mi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">hali e to malo xidine maxali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">kamɛna e ma,<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>e oliwi turen bama muxu gbɛtɛne sansanne kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">e walima manpa rafaladeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">koni e mi nɔɛ sese minɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Muxune faxamatɔɔn wugama taani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">muxu maxɔlɔxine wugama e mali feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">anu na fe mi findɛ tɛrɛna fe ra Ala xa.”<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>“Kɛnɛnyaan naɲaxu muxu ɲaxine ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">kira yiyalanxin mi rafan e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">e mi sigama a xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Faxa tiin kelima sogen godo waxatin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">a yi yiigelitɔɔn nun tɔrɔ muxun faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">a muɲan ti kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Yalunden ɲinbanna nan mamɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">a a falama nɛn, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">‘Muxu yo mi n toma,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">a yi a yɛtagin luxun.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Muɲaden banxin dɛɛn kalama kɔɛɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">yanyin na, a yɛtɛ mabalan a konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">a mi kɛnɛnna kolon.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Na muxune yanyin fɔlɔma sogen godo waxatin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">e bata dari kɔɛɛn magaxu feene ra.”<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>“Koni ɛ tan a falama, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">‘Ɲaxuden xalima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">alo se yelefuxina igen xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">a dɔxɔden yi findi yire dangaxin na bɔxɔn fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">a mɔn mi fa walima a manpa bili xɛɛn ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Balabalan kɛsɛne xuyama ayi kii naxan yi sogen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">yulubi kanne sigama na kii nin laxira yi.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Hali naxanye e barixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">ne ɲinanma nɛn e xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">e findi donseen na kunle xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">e fe falan mɔn yi dan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Nanara, tinxintareyaan kalama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">alo wudin na bira.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>“ ‘Na muxune ɲaxalan gbantane tɔrɔxi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">e mi kaɲa gilɛne mali.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Koni Ala nɔɛ sɛnbɛmane raxɔrɛ a sɛnbɛni nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">a na keli, a muxu ɲaxine halagi.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Ala ne luma bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun marakantanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">koni a yɛɛn tima nɛn e sigati kiin na.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Na muxune sabatima nɛn waxati di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">koni na xanbi ra, e lɔ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">e kɔnkɔrɔnma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">alo ɲɔxɔnde xarena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">e xun sinma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">alo se tɔnsɔnna xaba daxina.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>“Xa a mi na kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">nde n matandɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">a n ma falan nakala ayi?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s">Bilidadaa falan saxandena: Adamadiine mi tiyɛ Ala yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Suxa kaan Bilidada yi Yuba yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Sɛnbɛn nun magaxuna Ala nan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">a tan nan bɔɲɛ xunbenla rafama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">han kore xɔnna ma.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Nde nɔɛ a ganla yatɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">A sogen mi tema nde xun ma?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Adamadiin nɔɛ tinxinɲɛ di Ala yɛɛ ra yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Naxan barixi ɲaxanla xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">na rasariɲanma di?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Hali kiken mi fixa Ala yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">hali sarene mi sariɲan.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Adamadiine tan di nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">naxanye tide xurun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">alo kɔnɛne nun kunle?”<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabin Bilidada xa: I n yabima fuun nin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“I fatan sɛnbɛtarene maliyɛ yati!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">I bata fa fangatarene malideni!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>I fatan fekolontaren kawandɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">i yi a maxadi han!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Koni i ya falane tima nde xa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">I falani itoe tongoxi nde yii?”<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>“Faxa muxune niine xuruxurunma Ala yɛɛragaxuni laxira yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">naxanye bɔxɔ bun igene bun.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Ala yɛɛn laxira yiren birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">hali sayani muxe mi e luxunɲɛ a tan ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Ala nan kore xɔnni fulunxi na yigenla xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">a bɔxɔn singan na yigenli.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Ala tulen namarama kundani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">koni kundane mi kalama igen binyen bun.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>A yi a mangaya gbɛdɛn luxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">a yi a kundaan sa a yɛɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Ala yi digilinna sa fɔxɔ igen xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">naxan dan findixi kɛnɛnna nun dimin naralanden na.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Kore xɔnna sɛnbɛtɛnne xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">e kabɛ Alaa xɔlɔn ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Ala bata fɔxɔ igene nɔ a sɛnbɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">a yi ige yi ninginangan Raxabi faxa a xaxilimayani.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>A foyen bata kore xɔnna fixa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">a bata ige yi sube ɲaxin faxa a yiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">saɲin naxan a gima.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>A wali xurine nan itoe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">nxu a ɲununɲunun xuiin nan tun mɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Nayi, nde nɔɛ a sɛnbɛn galan xuiin kolonɲɛ?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yuba mɔn yi yabin ti: Sɔntaren nan n na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“N bata n kɔlɔ habadan Ala yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">naxan tondixi n ma kitin sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">naxan n niin nafexi xɔlɛn na,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>xa n niin mɔn n yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">xa Alaa foyen mɔn soma n ɲɔɛni,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>n bata n kɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">n dɛɛn mi tinxintareya falan tiyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">wule yo mi minɛ n dɛ.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Na miriyaan makuya n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">n xa ɲɔndin fi ɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">Han n yi faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">n mi n ma fɛtareya wanle kalɛ,<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>n luma nɛn tinxinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">n mi a beɲinɲɛ mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">n xaxinla mi n yalagɛ n ma simayani mumɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“N yaxun nan lan a yatɛ ɲaxuden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">naxan kelima n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">na xa yatɛ tinxintaren na!<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Ala kolontarena a yigin sama nanse yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">Ala na a niin ba a yi?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Tɔrɔn na fa a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">Ala a gbelegbele xuiin namɛ ba?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>A sɛwan sɔtɛ Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna yii ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">A Ala maxandɛ waxatin birin ba?”<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>“Iki, n na Ala sɛnbɛn yitama nɛn ɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">n mi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna miriyane luxunma ɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Ɛ birin bata a to ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">nayi, nanfera ɛ yɛtɛ luma fe fuune yi?”<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>“Ala nan kɛɛni ito ramaraxi ɲaxuden xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">ɲaxankata tiin naxan sɔtɔma Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna yii fa fala:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Xa e diine wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">e faxama yɛngɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">donseen yi dasa e yixɛtɛne ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Naxanye na lu e xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">furen yi ne faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">e kaɲa gilɛne mi e wugama.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Hali e gbeti fixɛn makɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">alo burunburunna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">e nun dugina alo borona,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>tinxin muxune nan e dugine ragodoma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">sɔntarene nan e gbeti fixɛni taxunma e ra.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>E banxine kala ɲaxun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">alo dondoli xuyenna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">alo kantan muxuna bubuna.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>E sama nɛn nafulu kanyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">koni a danna nan na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">e na xulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">e lima nɛn sese mi na.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Gaxuna e ratɛrɛnama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">alo fufana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">wuluwunla yi e xasun kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Sogeteden foyen yi e tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">a yi e xali wulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">a yi e ba e dɔxɔdeni,<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>a yi e radinɲɛ ayi kininkinintareyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">e yi e gi a sɛnbɛn bun ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Yamaan yi e yii bɔnbɔ e magele feen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">muxune yi kolin e dɔxɔde fonne birin kala kii ma.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s">Fekolonna wundona</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>“Ɲɔndin na a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">gbeti wure fixɛn geden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">xɛmaan fan nasariɲanden na,<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>wuren bama bɛndɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">wure gbeela fan bama gɛmɛn nin.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Wuren fen muxune kɛnɛnna raminima dimin nin bɔxɔn bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">e godoma wuren fenɲɛ han a dandena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">e wuren fen naxan luxunxi dimini bɔxɔn bun.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Wuren fen muxune yili tilinxine gema burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">muxu gbɛtɛ yo mi sigɛ dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">e makuya muxu gbɛtɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">e singanxin nan walima e yinle ra lutine ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Bɔxɔ xɔnna donseen fima en ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">koni, a bunni maxaxi alo tɛɛn nan a ganxi.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Gɛmɛ mamiloxi faɲine toma fanye yirene nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">xɛma fuɲin toma bɛndɛn nin.”<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>“Dugane mi na bɔxɔ bun kirane kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">sɛgɛn yɛɛn mi ne toma,<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>burunna sube yo munma siga e xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">yata yo munma dangu e xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Koni, muxun susuma fanyen gɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">a yi geyane ge han e danna,<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>a folon gema fanyene yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">a yi se kɛndɛne birin to a yɛɛn na,<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>a yi xude xunne xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">naxan luxunxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">a yi na ramini kɛnɛnni.”<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>“Koni, fekolonna minɛn yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Xaxilimayaan dɔxi minɛn yi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Adamadiine mi a saren kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">a mi niiramane yɛ bɔxɔ xɔnna fari.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Fɔxɔ ige gbeena a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">a naxa, ‘A mi n tan yii.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">Baan fan a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">a naxa, ‘A mi n tan yii.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Fekolonna mi sɔtɛ xɛmaan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">a mi sarɛ gbeti fixɛn na,<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>xɛmaan naxan kelima Ofiri yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">a mi sɔtɛ na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">hanma onixi gɛmɛ tofaɲina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">hanma gɛmɛ mamiloxi faɲina.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>A mi sɛ xɛmaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">a mi sɛ kilasi gɛmɛ fixɛ faɲin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">a mi masarɛ xɛma faɲin goronna ra.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>A dangu korala gɛmɛ tofaɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">nun gɛmɛ gbɛtɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">naxan fixa alo dayimuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">Fekolonna dangu bɔxɔ bun nafunla birin na.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Topasi gɛmɛ faɲin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">naxan keli Kusi yamanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">a mi sɛ na ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">a mi misalɛ xɛma sensenna ma.”<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>“Nayi, fekolonna kelima minɛn yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Xaxilimayaan dɔxi minɛn yi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>A luxunxi niiramane birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">hali xɔliin naxanye kore xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">ne mi a toma.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Sayaan nun laxira yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">e naxa, ‘Nxu a xinla nan gbansan mɛxi.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>“Koni, Ala a kiraan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">a tan nan keden a dɔxɔden kolon,<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>bayo a tan nan toon tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">han bɔxɔn danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">a seen birin toma kore xɔnna bun.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>A tan foyen sɛnbɛn danna saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">a yi igene danna sa,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>a yi tulen danna sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">a yi galanna kiraan sa.<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>Nayi, Ala yi fekolonna to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">a yi a fɛsɛfɛsɛ, a yi a makɛnɛn.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Na xanbi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">a yi a fala adamadiine xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Marigin yɛɛragaxun nan findixi fekolonna ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">Xaxilimayaan nan fe ɲaxin matangan na!’ ”<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa xun mafalana: Waxati danguxine yi ɲaxun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Yuba mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>“Xa n yi luyɛ nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">alo waxati danguxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">na yi lanɲɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">Na waxati danguxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">Ala yi yengi dɔxi n xɔn nun,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>a lɛnpun yi dɛgɛma n xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">n yi sigan tima a kɛnɛnna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">hali kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>N yi kɛndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">Alaa xanuntenyaan yi n konni.<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>Na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna mɔn yi n xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">n ma diine birin mɔn yi n dɛxɔn,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>n yi n sanne maxama nɔnɔn fɛnɛn nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">hali turen yi minima fanyeni n xa!<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>Na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">n na yi mini siga taan so dɛɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">n sa n ma gbɛdɛn dɔxɔ yamaan malandeni,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>banxulanne yi n to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">e yi xɛtɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">fonne yi keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">e lu tixi n yɛtagi,<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>kuntigine yi e falan dan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">e dundu,<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>mangane yi e falane dan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">e lɛnne yi xidi e dɛ kankeni.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Muxu yo na yi n ma falane mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">na kanna yi a falama nɛn n ma a dubadiina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">Muxu yo na yi n to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">a yi n matɔxɔ,<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>amasɔtɔ n yi yiigelitɔne ratangama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">naxanye yi e mawugama n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">n yi kiridine ratanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">muxu yo mi naxanye malima.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Saya furen yi muxun naxanye ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">ne yi dubama n tan nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">n yi kaɲa gilɛn nasɛwama.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Tinxinyaan yi ragodoxi n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">alo n ma domana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">kiti kɛndɛn nan yi findixi n ma dugin nun n ma kɔmɔtin na.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>N tan nan yi findixi danxutɔɔn yɛɛne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">n tan nan yi madɔntɔɔn sanne ra.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>N yi findixi tɔrɔ muxune fafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">n yi xɔɲɛne xun mayɛngɛ kitini.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>N tan nan yi tinxintarene sɛnbɛn kalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">n yi e se tongoxine ba e yii.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>Nayi, n yi a fala n yɛtɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">n naxa, ‘N faxama nɛn sabatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">n ma lɔxɔne gboma ayi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">alo ɲɛmɛnsinna,<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>n luma nɛn alo wudina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">naxan salen sinxi igeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">xiila sama naxan yii ra kɔɛɛn na.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>N ma binyen gboma ayi nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">n sɛnbɛn mi ɲanma mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">a lu alo xali bandunxina.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>“Na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">muxune yi e tuli matima n na sabarini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">N na yi e kawandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">e yi e dundu.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>N na yi falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">e mi yi a matandima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">N ma falane yi luxi nɛn e xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">alo tulen naxan godoma bɔxɔ xaren ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>E yi n mamɛma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">alo e tulen mamɛma kii naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">e dɛɛne yi lu yibixi n bun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">alo muxun naxanye tulen mamɛma soge furen na.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>E na yi yigitɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">n yi e ralimaniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">e mi yi wama fula feni n ma fanna ra.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>N tan nan yi dɔxi e xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">n kiraan yita e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">alo mangana a ganla xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">alo muxun naxan tɔrɔ muxune masabarima.”<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa xun mafalana: Tɔrɔya waxatin bata fa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>“Koni iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">n bata findi magele seen na diidine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">naxanye babaye yi raɲaxu n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">han n mi yi tinɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">e lu n ma barene yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">n ma xuruseene kantandeni.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>E babane yi nɔɛ nanse ligɛ n xa e sɛnbɛni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">E sɛnbɛn birin bata yi ɲan.<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Kamɛn nun tɔrɔn bata yi e raxadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">e yi donseen fenma tonbonna nin,<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>e yi donseen fenma fɔtɔnne nin burunna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">budemaan nan tun yi e yii balon na.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>E yi kedixi muxune yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">muxune gbelegbele e fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">alo muɲadene nan yi e ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>E yi e banxine tima geya kankene nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">e nun yili yirene nun faran yinle ra.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>E yi wugama fɔtɔndine nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">alo sofanle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">e yi sa e sa ɲanle yi.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Xaxilitarene nan ne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">xili mi e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">naxanye yi kedima gbelemɛn na yamanani.”<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>“Koni iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">n bata findi magele seen na e sigine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">e lu n konbɛ tun.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>N naɲaxu e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">e masigama n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">E mi sikɛma dɛgen naminɛ n yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Bayo Ala bata n sɛnbɛn kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">a yi n nayarabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">e mi fa yagima feen ligɛ n na.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Muxu kobine kelima n xili ma n yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">e katama n nabiradeni e sanne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">e n yɛngɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">alogo e xa n halagi.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>E bata n ma kirane kala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">Birin kataxi gbalon xa n sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">e mako mi muxu yo ma na feni.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>E fa n yɛngɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">alo sofane na fu taan ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">e yinna rabira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">E mi sikɛma fadeni n xili ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">n ɲaxankata waxatini.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Gaxun bata n nabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">n ma binyen bata siga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">alo foyen nan a xalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">n ma hɛrin waxatin bata dangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">alo kundana.”<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>“Iki, n niin bama n yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">Tɔrɔ lɔxɔne bata n li.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Xɔlɛna n suxuma kɔɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">han n xɔnne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">naxan dan mi na.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Ala n suxuma a sɛnbɛn birin yi n ma domaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">a yi n yidɛtɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">alo doma kɔɛɛn naxan muxune kɔɛni dɛtɛnma.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>A bata n woli boroni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">N bata lu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">alo xuben nun burunburunna.”<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>“N ma Ala, n na i xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">koni i mi n yabima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">N tima i yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">koni i n matoma nɛn gbansan.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>I bata i yɛɛ xɔdɔxɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">i n yɛngɛ i sɛnbɛn birin na.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>I bata n lu foyeni, a lu sigɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">Wuluwunla n xalima na xun xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>N na a kolon a i n xalima sayaan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">niiramane birin sigama dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>“N mi yi tɔrɔ muxune mali ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">naxanye n xili e ɲaxankatani?<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Naxanye yi tɔrɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">n mi wuga ne xɔn ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">N bɔɲɛn mi yi sunu yiigelitɔne fe ra ba?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>N yengi yi fe faɲine nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">koni fe ɲaxine bata fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">N yi kɛnɛnna nan mamɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">koni dimin bata fa.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Xabu tɔrɔna n sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">n kui seene ɲinma.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>N sigan tiin dimin nan tun yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">n mi sogen toma mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">N tima yamaan tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">n yi e mafan n mali feen na,<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>n wuga xuiin minima alo kankone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">alo dangaranfulene.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>N fati kidin bata fɔrɔ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">a yi koyen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">Fati mawolonna bata n xɔnne yili.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>N ma kondenna bata findi sunu sigi sa seen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">n ma xulenna yi findi wuga seen na.”<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa xun mafalan danna</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Nxu nun n yɛɛne bata layirin xidi fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">n nama sungutunna mato kunfani.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Xa n na liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Ala nanse rafɛ n ma keli kore?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna kɛɛn mundun nafama n ma keli kore?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Halagin mi fama tinxintareyaan xan xɔn ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">Gbalon mi fama hakɛ kanne xan xa ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Ala mi n sigati kiin toma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">A mi n san funfune birin yatɛn kolon ba?”<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>“Na ma, n sigan ti nɛn fuyantenyani ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">N sanne yi birama yanfan nin ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Ala xa n sa sikeli tinxinxin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">a yi n ma fɛtareya wanle to.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Xa n keli nɛn a kiraan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">xa n bɔɲɛn yi bira n yɛɛn fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">xa xɔsi yo yi lu n yiine ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>nayi, n naxan sixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">gbɛtɛ xa na don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">muxune yi n ma sansine matala na bɔxɔn ma.”<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>“Xa n bɔɲɛn kunfa nɛn ɲaxanla nde xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">xa n dɔxɔ nɛn n dɔxɔ bodena ɲaxanla yɛɛ ra,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>nayi, n ma ɲaxanla xa lu xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">e nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛye yi kafu.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Amasɔtɔ xa n yi na liga nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">n ma yalunyaan yi findima fe haramuxin nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">na yi findi hakɛn na kitisane naxan natɔrɔnɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>N ma kalan yi findin tɛɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">naxan yi n ganma han a n halagi fefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">a yi n hɛrisigɛn birin kala.”<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“N tondi nɛn kiti kɛndɛn sɛ n ma walikɛne xa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">e mawuga n fari waxatin naxan yi?<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>Xa n yi na liga nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">n nanse ligɛ Ala na keli waxatin naxan yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">A na na feen fɛsɛfɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">n na a yabima nanse ra?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Amasɔtɔ a tan Ala keden peen nan nxu birin daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">e tan nun n tan nxu ngane kui.”<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“N tondi nɛn tɔrɔ muxune maxɔdinna yabɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">N kaɲa gilɛne lu nɛn e yigitɛgɛni ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>N kedenna donseen don nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">n mi se so kiridine yii?<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Anu, xabu n foninge waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">n lu nɛn kiridine masuxɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">alo e fafane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">Xabu n da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">n na n yengi dɔxi kaɲa gilɛne xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>N yiigelitɔɔn to nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">dugi mi yi naxan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">hanma tɔrɔ muxuna marabɛnna yi naxan ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>n mi yi e marabɛri ba n ma yɛxɛɛ xabe dugi binyene ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">alogo e xa duba n xa?<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Xa n na n yiini te nɛn kiridin xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">bayo n kitisane maliin sɔtɔma nɛn,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>nayi, n tungunna xa ba n fanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">n yii tɔnsɔnna yi bolon n tɔnxɔnna ra.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>N mi yi na ligɛ bayo n gaxuxi Alaa gbalon yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">n mi nɔɛ tiyɛ a yɛtagi a nɔrɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">xa n yi na liga nun.”<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“N yi n yigin sa xɛmani ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">N yi a fala, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">‘I tan nan n kantan seen na?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">Ɛn-ɛn de!<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>N sɛwa nɛn n ma hɛrigɛ gbee kanyaan na ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">n nafunla naxanye sɔtɔ?<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>N to sogen to xɔlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">hanma n to kiken nayabuxin to kore xɔnna ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>n bɔɲɛn mi kunfa wundoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">N mi e batu mumɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Xa n yi na liga nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">na yi findima nɛn hakɛn na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">kitisane naxan natɔrɔnɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">nayi n bata yi Ala ramɛ nun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">naxan kore xɔnna ma.”<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“N sɛwa nɛn n yaxuna ɲaxankatan na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">N na n bodon nɛn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">fe ɲaxine to a li?<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>N mi n yaxune danga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">alogo Ala xa e faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">bayo n mi tinɲɛ yulubin tongɛ n fala xuine xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Naxanye birin yi fama n konni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">ne yi a falama nɛn, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Muxun birin lugoma suben na Yuba konni.’<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Xɔɲɛn mi yi xima tandeni mumɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">n yi n ma dɛɛn nabima nɛn dangu muxune xa.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>N na n ma murutɛ feene luxun nɛn ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">alo adamadi gbɛtɛye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">N na n hakɛne luxun n yɛtɛ yi ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>N yi gaxuxi yamana falan nan na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">I laxi a ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">a n yi gaxuxi denbayane maraɲaxun nan yɛɛ ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">han n yi n dundu, n lu n konni?<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>A yi rafanɲɛ n ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">n ma mawuga xuiin yi ramɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">N ma fala dɔnxɛne ni i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">n na n yii fɔxɔn sama naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna xa n yabi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Xa n yaxun yi mawuga kɛdin sɛbɛ n xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">na yi rafanɲɛ n ma.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>N yi a sama nɛn n tungunna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">n yi a so n xunna alo manga kɔmɔtina.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>N nan n sigati kiin yɛbama nɛn a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">n yi fa a yɛtagi alo kuntigina.”<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“N ma bɔxɔn yi gbelegbele n xili ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">N ma xɛɛne yi e mawuga n fari ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>N yi muxune bogi seene don ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">n mi e saren fi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">N yi e kanne tɔrɔ ba?<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>Xa n yi na liga nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">nayi, ɲanle xa sabati n ma xɛɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">benun murutun xa sabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">sɛxɛn yi sabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">benun fundenna xa sabati.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Yubaa falane danna ni ito ra.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu a falana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Elifasi nun Bilidada nun Sofara yi ba falan tiyɛ Yuba xa, bayo a yi a yɛtɛ mirixi tinxinden nan na. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Nayi, Elihu yi xɔlɔ, Busi kaan Barakɛli a dii xɛmɛn naxan Rami xabilani. A xɔlɔ Yuba xili ma, amasɔtɔ a yi a falama nɛn a a tinxin Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>A mɔn yi xɔlɔ xɛmɛ saxanne ma, bayo e mi yabi faɲin sɔtɔxi Yuba ra, na feen yi lu alo Ala nan findixi fe kalan na. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Bayo e yi fori a xa, Elihu yi a sabari, a munma yi falan ti Yuba xa. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Koni Elihu to a to yabi mi yi fa xɛmɛ saxanna ne dɛ, a yi xɔlɔ.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Nayi, Elihu, Busi kaan Barakɛli a dii xɛmɛn yi falan ti, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">“N tan nan mɔn foningeyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">fonna nan ɛ tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">nanara n yi xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">n gaxu n ma kolonna yitɛ ɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>N yi a mirixi nɛn, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">‘Fonne nan lanma e falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">fonne nan lan e fekolonna xaranna ti.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Koni ɲɔndin naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">naxan xaxinla fima muxun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">niin nan na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">naxan kelima Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna niiraxinli.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Siimayaan xa mi tun fama fekolonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">kiti kɛndɛn kolonna mi fama foriyaan xan xɔn tun.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>Nanara, n na a falama, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">‘Yuba, i tuli mati n fan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">N fan xa n ma kolonna yita i ra.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>“Han iki, n bata ɛ falane ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">n yi waxi ɛ fe kolon falane nan namɛ fe yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">han ɛ yi ɛ falane yɛba.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>N na n tuli matixi nɛn ɛ ra ki faɲi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">koni ɛ tan sese a fala mi Yuba kɛnɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">ɛ tan sese mi a falane yabixi a faɲin na.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Ɛ nama a fala, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">‘Nxu bata yabin sɔtɔ fekolonni fa fala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Ala nan keden nɔɔn sɔtɛ Yuba ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">muxun mi a ra.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Yuba mi a falane tixi n tan xan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">n mi a yabima alo ɛ tan.”<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>“Yuba, i lanfane bata tunnaxɔlɔ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">e mi fa i yabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">fala mi fa e xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>N mɔn xa lu sabarixi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">hali e to mi fa fala tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">bayo e bata e dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">e mi fa yabi tima?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>N fan waxi n ma yabin ti feni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">N fan waxi n ma kolonna yita feni,<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>bayo fala gbegbe n kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">n xaxinla n nadinma n xa falan ti,<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>na bata n bɔɲɛn nate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">alo manpa nɛnɛn naxan wuyenna a sa seen balanxini bɔma.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>N xa falan ti, nanara a godɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">n xa n dɛni bi, n yi n ma yabin fi.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>N mi muxu yo rafisama a bode xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">N mi muxu yo matɔxɔma.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>A yɛtɛna, n mi fatan muxu matɔxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">xanamu, naxan n daxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">na yi n faxama nɛn mafurɛn.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu a falane: Ala muxune maxadima tɔrɔyaan nan xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>Elihu mɔn yi a fala Yuba xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">“Yuba, iki i tuli mati n ma falane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">i tuli mati n ma falane ra ki faɲi.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>N nan n dɛni bima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">n falan ti i xa.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>N ma falane n ma bɔɲɛ faɲiyaan nan makɛnɛnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">n na n ma kolonna ɲɔndin nan falama i xa.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan n daxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna niiraxinla nan niin biraxi n yi.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>N yabi, xa i nɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">i yitɔn, i fa n yabi n yɛtagi.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>En birin lan Ala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">n fan baxi bɛndɛn nin.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Nayi, i nama gaxu n tan yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">n mi i ɲaxankatama.”<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>“Koni, i fala xuiin mɔn n tunla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">n bata i ya falane mɛ dɔxɔ wuyaxi,<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>i naxa, ‘Fɛ yo mi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">murutɛde mi n na Ala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">N sariɲan, hakɛ mi n ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Anu, Ala mɔn fɛɛn toma n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">a n yatɛxi a yaxun na.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>A n sanne sama kutun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">a yɛɛn tixi n sigati kiin birin na.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Koni, na feen ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">n xa a fala i xa, ɲɔndi mi i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">amasɔtɔ Ala dangu adamadiin birin na.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Nanfera i a matandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">a to mi a dɛntɛgɛma i xa?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Anu, Ala falan tima muxune xa kii wuyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">koni e mi e tuli matima a ra.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>A falan tiin muxune xa xiyene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">nun fe toni kɔɛɛn na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">Xixɔli gbeen na dangu muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">e nɛma saxi e sadene ma,<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>nayi, Ala yi feene yita muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">a yi e rakolon,<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>alogo a xa muxune ba e wali ɲaxine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">a yi e ratanga wason ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Nayi, Ala muxun niin natangama nɛn gaburun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">a yi a rakisi laxira yi.”<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>“Ala mɔn muxun natɔrɔnma tɔrɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">naxan a rakankanma a sadeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">a xɔnne yi lu a xɔlɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Nayi, donseen yi raɲaxu a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">hali donse ɲaxumɛne.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>A yi doyen mafurɛn, a yi xɔsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">han a xɔnna naxanye mi yi toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">ne yi mini kɛnɛnni.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>A yi maso gaburun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">a niin yi so saya malekane yii.”<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>“Koni, na yi lan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">xa Alaa malekana nde fa a fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">naxan findɛ tagi yitɔn keden peen na wuli kedenna yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">a kira tinxinxin yita a ra.<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>Malekan yi kininkinin a ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Ala, i nama tin a xa godo gaburun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">n bata a xunbaan sɔtɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>Nayi, na muxun fatin mɔn yi a dii ɲɔrɛ sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">a mɔn yi sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">alo a foninge waxatina.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Nayi, na muxun na falan ti Ala xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">a yi a yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">a yi fa gbelegbelɛ Ala yɛtagi sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">amasɔtɔ Ala bata a tinxinyaan saren fi a ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>A luma sigin sɛ nɛn yamaan yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">a naxa, ‘N yulubin tongo nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">n yi sariyan kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">koni Ala mi na saranxi n na.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Ala bata n niin natanga gaburun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">n luma nɛn kɛnɛnna nin.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Ala na birin ligama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">a ligama nɛn sanɲa ma wuyaxi muxune xa,<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>alogo a xa e niin natanga gaburun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">alogo e xa lu e nii ra kɛnɛnni.”<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Yuba, i tuli mati n na ki faɲi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">I dundu, n xa falan ti i xa.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>N yabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">xa falana nde i xɔn, falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">amasɔtɔ n waxi i ya tinxinyaan to feni.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Xanamu, i tan nan lan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">i tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">i dundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">n xa i xaran fekolonna ma.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="s">Tinxinna kanna nan Ala ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Nayi, Elihu mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Fekolonne, ɛ n ma falane ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">ɛ tan xaxilimane, ɛ tuli mati n na!<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Bayo, muxun tunla nɔɛ falane fɛsɛfɛsɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">alo a dɛɛn to nɔɛ donse faɲin kolonɲɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>En birin xa kiti kɛndɛn fen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">en na a kolon en bode tagi naxan fan.”<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Yuba bata yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">a naxa, ‘N tinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">koni Ala mi tinxi kiti kɛndɛn sɛ n xa.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Yoona n tan nan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">koni n yatɛxi wuleden nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">N ma furen mi yalanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">hali n to mi murutɛxi Ala ma.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>“Muxun mundun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">naxan luxi alo Yuba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">A magelen tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">alo a igen minma kii naxan yi,<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>a birama fe ɲaxi rabane fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">e nun ɲaxudene sigan tima,<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>bayo Yuba bata yi a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">a naxa, ‘Muxun mi sese sɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">a na kata e nun Ala xa lan.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>“Nayi, xaxilimane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">ɛ tuli mati n na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Ala mi ɲaxu mumɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Tinxintare mi Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna ra mumɛ!<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Ala muxune saranma e kɛwanla nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">a birin suxu a sigati kiin xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Ɲɔndin nan na ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Ala mi fe ɲaxin ligama!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna mi kiti kɛndɛn kalama!<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Nde Ala dɔxi bɔxɔn xun na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Nde dunuɲa birin taxuxi a ra?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Xa Ala yi mirixi a yɛtɛ nan tun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">a yi a niin namara a yɛtɛ xa,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>nayi, daliseene birin yi faxama nɛn sanɲa ma kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">adamadiine mɔn yi xɛtɛ bɛndɛni.”<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“Yuba, xa i xaxinla na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">ito ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">i tuli mati n fala xuine ra.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Kiti kɛndɛn naɲaxu naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">na nɔɛ mangayaan ligɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">I susɛ tinxinden yalagɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">a tan naxan sɛnbɛ kanna ra?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Ala nan keden pe nɔɛ susɛ a falɛ mangan xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">a naxa, ‘Fuyantenna!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">Ala nan tun a falɛ kuntigine xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">a naxa, ‘Ɲaxudene!’<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Ala mi kuntigine rafisama e bode xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">a mi yiigelitɔɔn nun nafulu kanna tagi rasaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">amasɔtɔ a tan nan e birin daxi.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>E birin faxama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Kɔɛ tagini, Ala na e yigisan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">e raxɔri, sɛnbɛmane fe yi godo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Na mi fatama muxu yo ra.”<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Ala yɛɛn tixi muxune sigati kiin birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">a e san funfune birin yatɛma.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Dimi yo mi fa na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">fe ɲaxi rabane nɔɛ e luxunɲɛ naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Ala mako mi fa muxune kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">benun a xa e xali kiti sadeni.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>A hayu mi fa sɛnbɛmane fenna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">benun a xa e kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">a mɔn yi muxu gbɛtɛ dɔxɔ e funfuni.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Ɲɔndin nan na ra, a e kɛwanle kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">Kɔɛ kedenna ra, a yi e ba, a yi e faxa.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>A e ɲaxankatama nɛn yamaan yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:26">alo fe ɲaxi rabane,<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>bayo e bata xɛtɛ Ala fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">e yi a sariyane birin beɲin.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>E yi yiigelitɔne ɲaxankata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">han e yi e xuini te Ala ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">Nayi, Ala yi tɔrɔ muxune wuga xuiin namɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>“Koni, xa Ala lu dunduxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">nde a yalagɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Xa a a yɛtagin luxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">nde nɔɛ a toɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Anu, a mɔn luma muxune nun siyane birin xun na nɛn<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>alogo Ala kolontaren nama dɔxɔ mangayani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">naxan findima kalan na yamaan xa.”<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“A nɔɛ ligɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">muxuna nde yi a fala Ala xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">‘N bata kalan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">koni n mi fa fe ɲaxin ligama sɔnɔn.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>N mi naxan toma, na yita n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">Xa n bata tinxintareyaan liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">n mi fa a ligama sɔnɔn.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Ala lan a xa na kanna ratɔrɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">fata i miriyaan na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">I tan naxan Ala rasɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">i tan naxan tondixi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">I tan nan lan i yi a yɛba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">n tan mi a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">i miriyaan fala.”<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>“Xaxilimane a falama nɛn n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">e nun fekolonna</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">naxanye n xuiin namɛma, e naxa,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Yuba falan tima fekolontareyaan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">xaxilimaya mi a falane ra.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>A lan Yuba yi lu kitin dɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">han a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">bayo a falan tima alo fe ɲaxi rabana.<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>A mɔn murutɛn sama a yulubin fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">a Ala magelema en yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">a falane mi ɲanma Ala xili ma.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu a falane: Fe fuun nan Yubaa falane ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Nayi, Elihu mɔn yi falan ti, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“I laxi a ra a ɲɔndina i xa ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">I yi a fala, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">‘N tinxin Ala yɛɛ ra yi.’<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Koni, i mɔn a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">i naxa, ‘N to mi yulubi ligaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">na tɔnɔn nanse ra n tan xa?’ ”<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>“Awa, n tan nan i yabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">e nun i xɔyin naxanye i fɛma.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>I yɛɛn ti kore, i kundaan mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">e mate i xun ma pon!<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Xa i yulubin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">na sa Ala tɔrɛ mɛnni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">I ya murutɛn na gbo ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">na nanse ligɛ a ra?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Xa i tinxin, na nanse fima Ala ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">A nanse sɔtɔma i yii na ma?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>I ya fe ɲaxine muxune nan tun tɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">i ya tinxinyaan munanfanna muxune nan ma.”<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>“Ɲaxankatan na gbo ayi yamaan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">e mawugama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">Sɛnbɛmaan na e tɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">e xui ramini malina fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Koni, muxu yo mi a falɛ, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">‘Ala minɛn, a tan naxan n daxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">A muxune rawɛkilɛma e bɛtin ba dimini,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>a en xaranma burunna subene kɛɲane xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">A fekolonna fi en ma xɔline kiine xɔn.’<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Na muxune gbelegbelema malina fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">koni Ala mi e yabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">bayo e tan findixi fe ɲaxi rabane nun wasodene nan na.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>E gbelegbelema fuyan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Ala mi e ramɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna mi a tuli matima e xuiin na.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>A i xuiin namɛma di nayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">i tan naxan a falama a i mi a toma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">I yi a fala a i bata i ya kitin so a yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">i a tan nan mamɛma!<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Iki, bayo Alaa xɔlɔn munma fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">e nun a mi a tuli matixi murutɛ falane ra,<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>nayi, Yuba luma a fala fuun nan tun tiyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">a yi fekolontare falane rawuya ayi.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="s">Elihu a falane: Ala adamadiine xaranma kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Elihu mɔn yi siga falan ma, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“I mɔn xa tin ndedi, n xa i xaran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">amasɔtɔ fala gbegbe mɔn n xɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">n naxan falɛ i xa Ala fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>N nan n ma kolonna fenma yire makuyen nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">n yi yoon fi Ala ma naxan n daxi.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Wule mi n ma falane ra mumɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">N tan naxan be i yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">n ma fekolonna kamalixi.”<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Ala sɛnbɛn gbo yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">a mi muxu yo rawolima ayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">A sɛnbɛn gbo a xaxilimayaan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>A mi ɲaxudene luma e nii ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">A kiti kɛndɛn sama yiigelitɔne xa.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>A mi a xun xanbi soma tinxin muxune yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">koni a e fe yitema nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">a yi e dɔxɔ manga gbɛdɛne yi habadan.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Xa e xidixi yɔlɔnxɔnne ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">xa e tɔrɔni,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>Ala e kɛwanle nan makɛnɛnma e xa na kiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">e nun e murutɛ feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">e naxanye ligaxi wasoni.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>A yi e xaran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">a e xa e tuli mati e xuru falane ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">a yi e yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">a e xa xɛtɛ e hakɛn fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Xa e tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">e yi a yamarin suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">e siimayaan danguma hɛrin nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">e yi e dunuɲa yi gidin ɲan sɛwani.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Xa e mi a ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">e faxama nɛn yɛngɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">e halagi e fe kolontareyani.”<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Ala kolontarene nan xɔlɔn namarama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">e mi Ala maxandima malina fe ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">hali a na e ratɔrɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>E faxama e foningeyaan nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">e siimayaan yi raɲan yagin ma yalundene tagi.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Koni, Ala tɔrɔ muxune rakisima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">e tɔrɔn nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">a yi e rakolon ɲaxankatan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>A i tan fan bama nɛn tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">a yi dɔxɔde rafulunxin fi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">a yi i ya tabanla rafe donse faɲine ra.”<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>“Koni iki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">kitin naxan nagidixi fe ɲaxi rabane xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">na bata i sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">Ala to a kiti kɛndɛn sa i xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">a yi i yalagi.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Nayi, xɔlɔn nama i radin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">i yi fe kobin liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">i nama xɛtɛ Ala fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">bayo na saren gbo.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>I ya nafunle i bɛ tɔrɔni ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">Hali i sɛnbɛ gbeen mi nɔɛ i maliyɛ iki.<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>A xɔli nama i suxu kɔɛɛn xa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">alogo i xa muxune ba e konne yi.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>A liga i yeren ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">I nama fa hakɛn liga sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">i bata yi gbalon sɔtɔ na fe ra.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>I xa a kolon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">a Alaa binyen gbo a sɛnbɛni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">Nde nɔɛ xaranna tiyɛ alo a tan?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Nde kiraan yitaxi a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">Nde nɔɛ a falɛ, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">‘I bata tinxintareyaan liga?’ ”<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>“I nama ɲinan Alaa wanle matɔxɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">muxune birin naxanye fe falama e bɛtine yi,<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>adamadiine birin nɔɛ naxanye toɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">e yi e mato wulani.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Ala gbo yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">en mi a gboon danna kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">a siimayaan dan mi na.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>A na igen nate wuyenni kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">a yi na findi tulen na mɛnni.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Na tulen yi keli kundane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">a godo adamadiine ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Nde nɔɛ kundaan nafala kiin kolonɲɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">e nun galanna godon kii naxan yi keli kore?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>A mato, a kuyen ɲin masɔxɔnna raminima a rabilinni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">a fɔxɔ igen nafema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">han dimin yi so a tilinna ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>A yamaan makitima na tulen nan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">a donse gbegbe fi e ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>A galanna tongoma a yii firinne nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">a yi a ragodo a na wa dɛnaxan xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>A kuye sarinna a fa feen nan mayitama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">hali xuruseene a fa feen kolon.”<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Nanara, n bɔɲɛn xuruxurunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">a keli a sadeni.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Ɛ tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">ɛ tuli mati kuye sarinna ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">naxan findixi Ala xuiin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">a sɔnxɔ xuiin naxan minima a dɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Ala a galanna ragodoma keli kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">a yi a ragodo dunuɲa birin xun xɔn.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Na xanbi ra, a sɔnxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">a yi a xui gbeen namini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">alo kuye sarinna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">a mi fa galanni tima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">a na a xui ramini.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>A kabanako feene rabama a sɔnxɔ xuiin xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">en mi nɔɛ naxanye famunɲɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>“Ala yi balabalan kɛsɛne yamari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">a naxa, ‘Ɛ godo bɔxɔni,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">a yi tulen nagodo, tule gbeen yati.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>A yi muxune wanle ratima na kii nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">alogo ne birin xa a wanla kolon.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Hali burunna subene soma nɛn faranne kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">e lu e yinle ra.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Kala ti foyen yi keli sogeteden yiifanna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">xunbenla yi keli kɔmɛn fɔxɔni.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Ala niiraxinla nan ige xundin naminima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">igen xunmaan yi xɔdɔxɔ alo wurena.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>A yi kundane rafe tule igen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">e nun kuye ɲin masɔxɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">a yi e raxuya ayi yiren birin yi.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>A tan nan e rasigama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">alo a ragidixi kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">alogo e xa a yamarin birin nakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">dunuɲa birin yi.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Nayi, Ala a waxɔnna nan ligama bɔxɔn fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">a yi muxune ratɔrɔn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">hanma a yi hinan e ra.”<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Yuba, i tuli mati ito ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">Ti, i maɲɔxɔn Alaa kabanako feene ma!<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">Ala e yamarima kii naxan yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">a galanna ragodoma kii naxan yi kundani?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">e singanxi kii naxan yi foyeni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Kabanako feni itoe findixi fekolon kamalixina wanla nan na.<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Koni i tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">i luma kuye wolonxini i ya dugine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">foyen nɛma bɔxɔn ganɲɛ waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>I nɔɛ Ala maliyɛ kuyen dadeni ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">naxan xɔdɔxɔ alo wure kikena?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>Yuba, a yita nxu ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">nxu nɔɛ naxan falɛ Ala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">Sese mi makɛnɛnxi nxu xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">nxu dimin nin.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>N mi waxi n xa falan ti Ala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Muxu mundun waxi Ala xa a raxɔri?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Muxu yo mi nɔɛ a yɛɛn tiyɛ sogen na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">a na te kore,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">foyen na kundaan ba a yɛɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Na ki kedenni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Alaa kɛnɛnna fama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">sa keli sogeteden kɔmɛn fɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">naxan luxi alo xɛmana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">nɔrɔn gbeen yi Ala rabilin.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">en mi nɔɛ en masoɛ naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">a sɛnbɛn gbo, a kiti kɛndɛne gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">a mi muxu tinxinxine ɲaxankatama.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Nanara, muxune gaxuma a yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">koni a tan yɛtɛɛn mi na muxune yatɛxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">naxanye e yɛtɛ yatɛxi xaxilimane ra.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa yabin Yuba xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Nayi, Alatala yi Yuba yabi wuluwulu gbeeni, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>“Nde i tan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">naxan n ma fe ragidixine yidimima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">a xaxilitareya falane xɔn?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Keli, i yitɔn alo xɛmɛ wɛkilɛxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">n xa i maxɔdin, i yi n yabi.”<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>“I yi minɛn yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">n to yi bɔxɔn bɛtɛn sama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">A yɛba n xa, xa i ɲɔndin kolon.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Nde dunuɲa danne sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">i na kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Nde lutini bandun a yi a maliga?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Bɔxɔ xɔnna bɛtɛn saxi nanse fari?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Nde a tongon gɛmɛn dɔxi,<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>xɔtɔn ma sarene to yi bɛtine bama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">Alaa malekane to yi gbelegbelema sɛwani?”<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>“Nde fɔxɔ igen balanxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">alogo a xa a raxara a dɔxɔdeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">a to yi minima a dadeni?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>N yi kundaan findi a dugin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">n yi kunda fɔrɛn findi a mafilin dugin na,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>n nan n ma sariyan sa a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">n yi a danne sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">n to yi dɛɛne nun balan seene sama a ma.<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>N yi a fala fɔxɔ igen xa, n naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">‘I fama nɛn han be, i nama dangu be ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">I mɔrɔn gbeene danma be nin yati.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">38.11</char> <char style="fk">Igen mɔrɔnne:</char> alo foyen na so igeni.</note><verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>“I bata yamarin fi xɔtɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">i ya siimayani ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">hali sanɲa ma keden pe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">I bata a miniden yita subaxan na ba,<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>alogo a xa bɔxɔn suxu a danne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">a yi a yimaxa, a yi ɲaxudene kedi?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Sogen na te, a yi bɔxɔni yalan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">a yigbɛ alo yii fɔxɔn bɛndɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">a kɛnɛnna yi so dunuɲa xun na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">alo dugina.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Koni, ɲaxudene kumama nɛn e waxatin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">e sɛnbɛn yi kala.”<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>“I bata siga ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">han fɔxɔ igen xunna?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">I bata i masiga ti fɔxɔ igen tilinna ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Laxira so dɛɛne yita nɛn i ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">I sayaan so dɛɛne to nɛn ba?”<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>“I bɔxɔna gboon yatɛn kolon ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">A fala n xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">xa i na feene birin kolon.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>I kɛnɛnna dɔxɔden kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">I a kolon dimin konna dɛnaxan yi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>I nɔɛ e bɛ e yirene yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">I e konna kiraan bayen kolon?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>I lan i yi a kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">to mi i tan naxan da.”<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>“I bata siga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">han ige xundin namaran dɛnaxan yi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">I bata balabalan kɛsɛne ramaradene to ba?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>N ne dɔxi gbalon waxatine nan yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">e nun sɔnxɔ nun yɛngɛ lɔxɔne.<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">kɛnɛnna minin kiraan naxan xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">sogetede foyen kelima dɛnaxan yi?”<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>“Nde kiraan nabaxi tule igen xa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">Nde kiraan yitaxi kuye sarinna ra?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Nde tulen nafama bɔxɔn fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">muxu yo mi dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">e nun tonbonni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">muxe mi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi?<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>Nde igen nafama yire xarene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">alogo sɛxɛn xa sabati?”<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>“Tulen fafe na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Nde xiila barixi?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Ige xundina nga na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">Nde xunbenla barixi?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Igen xɔdɔxɔma alo gɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">ige xundin yi sa fufaan xun ma.”<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>“Nde nɔɛ sare kuru Dii Tɛmɛ Soloferene yɔlɔnxɔnna tugunɲɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">I tan nɔɛ sare kuru Donsona lutin fulunɲɛ ba?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">38.31</char> Mɛn kaane yi <char style="fk">sare kurune</char> yatɛxi nɛn alo se sawurane, e yi na sare kurune xili sa na seene xun ma. </note><verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>I nɔɛ sare kurune raminɛ e waxatini ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">i yi sare kuru Kanko Gbeen nun a diine rasiga ti?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">yanban seene koreni sigama sariyan naxanye ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">I tan nan yanban seene sɛnbɛn nawalima bɔxɔn ma ba?”<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>“I xuiin tɛ han kundane ma kore xɔnna ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">i yi e yamari a tulen xa fa i ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>I tan nan kuye sarinne rasigama ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">e yi a fala i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">e naxa, ‘Nxu tan ni i ra?’<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Nde fekolonna saxi muxun bɔɲɛni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">Nde xaxilimayaan fixi a ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Nde nɔɛ kundaan yatɛ a xaxilimayaan xɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">Nde nɔɛ ige sa seene xun sinɲɛ kore,<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>gbangbanna yi findi boron na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">bɔxɔn kobelene yi dɔxɔ e bode ra?”<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala nan subene birin kanna ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>“I tan nan donseen soma yata gilɛn yii ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">I tan nan kamɛn bama yata sɛnbɛmane ma ba,<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>e nɛma sa e yinla kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">hanma e nɛma luxunxi subene yɛɛ ra?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Nde donseen soma xaxaan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">a diine na e xuini te Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">a na siga na xun xɔn donse fendeni?”<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“I a kolon ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">bolen diin xalima waxatin naxan yi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">I xɛnle toma ba, e nɛma diin xalɛ?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>I e kuiin maxali waxatin yatɛma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">I e dii xali waxatin kolon ba,<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>e na e felen e dii xalin tɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">e yi e diin xali?<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>E diine sɛnbɛn sɔtɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">e gbo xunnabani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">Na xanbi ra, e keli e ngane fɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">e mi fa fama sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Nde burunna sofanla xunnabaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Nde a fulunxi?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>N bata tonbonna findi a dɔxɔden na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">fɔxɔ bɔxɔn yi findi a konna ra.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>A na sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔ xuiin mɛ taane yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">a gele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">a mi soo ragiin xuiin mɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>A sigama a dɛgɛdeni geyane nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">dɛnaxan xinde, a yi mɛn fen.”<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Burunna ɲingen tinɲɛ findɛ i ya walikɛɛn na ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">A xiyɛ i ya xuruseene balon sa seen dɛxɔn ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>I nɔɛ a xidɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">alogo a xa i ya xɛɛn bi ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">A xɛɛ rabɔnbɔ seen bandunɲɛ i fɔxɔ ra mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>I yigin sɛ a yi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">bayo a sɛnbɛn gbo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">I ya wali xɔdɛxɛne luyɛ a ma ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>I yengi sɛ a ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">A fɛ i ya se xabaxine ra i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">a fa e sa i ya lonna ma?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>Dangaranfulene gabutɛne yitema sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">koni e mi nɔɛ tuganɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">alo xɔliin bodene.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>A xɛlɛne luma biraxi bɔxɔn nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">a yi e lu burunburun wolonni.<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>A mi mirixi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">fa fala e nɔɛ yibɔɛ nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">a burunna subena nde tiyɛ e yi nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>A ɲaxu a diine ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">alo a tan xa mi e xalixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">a mi gaxuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">fa fala a bata tɔrɔ fuuni e xalideni.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Ala bata a kuma fe kolonna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">a mi xaxili fixi a ma.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Koni, a na keli a gideni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">a gelema nɛn soon nun soo ragiin ma.”<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“I tan nan sɛnbɛn fima soon ma ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">I tan nan a kɔɛ ma xabene saxi ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>I nɔɛ a ratuganɲɛ alo suɲɛna?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">A gbelegbele xuiin magaxun nan tima.<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>A bɔxɔni sɔxɔnma a torone ra lanbanni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">a sɛwaxi a fangan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">a sigama ganla yɛɛ ra yɛngɛni.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Gaxun bɔtɛ mi a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">a mi kuisanna kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">a mi xɛtɛma a xanbi ra silanfanna yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Xalimakuli sa seen nun tanban gbeen nun a xurin naxan xidixi a fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">ne xuiin minima a nɛma a giyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>A kunfaxin tuganma, a siga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">Xɔtaan na fe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">a mi fa nɔɛ tiyɛ yɛngɛni.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Xɔta xuiin na mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">a gbelegbele sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">a yɛngɛn xirin mɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">hali a nɛma sa wulani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">e nun kuntigine gbelegbele xuiin nun yɛngɛ so xuina.”<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Sɛgɛn tuganma i ya xaxilimayaan nan xɔn ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">a yi a gabutɛne yibandun sogeteden yiifanna binni?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Singbinna tuganma i ya yamarin nan bun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">a yi a tɛɛn sa geya matexine fari?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>A yigiyaxi gɛmɛ yirene nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">a yire makantanxine nin geyane xuntagi.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>A a donseen fenma mɛnna nin</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">a nɛma dɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">a yi sa a to yire makuyeni.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Binbine dɛnaxan yi, a mɛnna nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">a diine baloma wunla nan na.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala Yuba xa, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“I tan naxan Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna yalagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">i mɔn luyɛ a matandɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">I tan naxan Ala mafalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">i nɔɛ a yabɛ?”<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuba yi Ala yabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Yuba yi Alatala yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Sese mi n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">N nɔɛ i yabɛ nanse ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Fɔ n na n yiin sa n dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">n yi n dundu.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>N bata falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">n mi fa yabi tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">N bata a radangu ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">n mi fa sese falama.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa yabina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Alatala yi Yuba yabi wuluwulu gbeeni, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>“Keli, i yitɔn alo xɛmɛ wɛkilɛxina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">n xa i maxɔdin, i yi n yabi.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>I waxi a fala feen nin ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">fa fala a n mi kiti kɛndɛn sama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">I waxi n yalagi feen nin ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">i yi yoon fi i yɛtɛ ma?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>I sɛnbɛn gbo alo Ala ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">I xuiin findɛ kuye sarinna ra ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">alo Ala gbeena?”<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>“I yɛtɛ maxidi binyen nun gboon na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">i yi i maxidi nɔrɔn nun xunnayerenna ra.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>I ya xɔlɔn nasiga muxune ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">i wasodene birin nagodo sanɲa yi kedenni.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>I wasodene birin nagodo sanɲa yi kedenni yati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">i ɲaxudene birin halagi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">e dɛnaxanye yi,<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>i yi ne birin maluxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">i yi e balan gaburun kui.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Nayi, xa i yi na liga nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">n tan yɛtɛɛn yi i matɔxɔma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">bayo i yɛtɛ sɛnbɛn yi i rakisima nɛn.”<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>“Malinna mato, sube magaxuxina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">N tan nan a daxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">alo n ni i daxi kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">A sɛxɛn donma alo ɲingena.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>A sɛnbɛna a tagin nin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">A sɛnbɛna a fudi ma fasane nin.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>A xunla xɔdɔxɔ alo sumanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">a danba subene fasane yibalanxi ken!<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>A xɔnne fan luxi alo sulana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">a ɲɛnsɛn xɔnne luxi alo wurena.”<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>“A findixi Alaa dalise fisamantenna nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">N tan, a da mangan nan keden nɔɔn sɔtɔma a ma silanfanna ra.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>A balon sɔtɔma geyane fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">burunna subene birin dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>A sama wudine nan bun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">a yi a luxun dara yi gbalane bun,<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>a matabuma wudine nininna nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">wudin naxanye xuden dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">ne yi a rabilin.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Xa igen gbo ayi, a mi gaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">hali Yurudɛn baa igen fa han a dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">a luma nɛn xaxili sani.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Xa a yɛɛne rabixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">nde nɔɛ a suxɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">Nde nɔɛ a suxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">a wuren bira a ɲɔɛni?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ige yi sube ɲaxina</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 40:25"/>I ige yi sube ɲaxin suxɛ kɔnna ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:25">I a suxɛ a lɛnna ma ba i ya lutin na?<verse eid="JOB 40:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 40:26"/>I gbalan sɔtɛ a ɲɔɛɛn kui ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:26">i yi a gbɛgbɛn sɔxɔn wuren na?<verse eid="JOB 40:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 40:27"/>I mirixi a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:27">a kankanɲɛ i mafanna ma ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:27">a fala faɲine ti i xa?<verse eid="JOB 40:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 40:28"/>A layirin xidɛ ɛ tagi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:28">a findɛ i ya konyin na habadan?<verse eid="JOB 40:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 40:29"/>I sabaan soɛ a ra ba alo xɔlina?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:29">I lutin xidɛ a sanna ra ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:29">i yi a so i ya dii tɛmɛne yii?<verse eid="JOB 40:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 40:30"/>Yɛxɛ suxune a matiyɛ lɔxɔni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:30">e a yitaxunɲɛ yulane ra?<verse eid="JOB 40:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 40:31"/>I nɔɛ a kidin kalɛ xalimakunle ra ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:31">I nɔɛ a xunna sɔxɔnɲɛ kulundene ra ba?<verse eid="JOB 40:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 40:32"/>Nayi, hali i yiin din a ra a yɛngɛ xinla ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">sanɲa ma keden pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">i mi fa na ɲɔxɔn ligama sɔnɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 40:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“Muxun naxan waxi a xa a nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">na a yɛtɛ nan madaxuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Muxu yo na a to tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">na birama nɛn a xanbiramaan na.<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Muxu yo mi susɛ yɛngɛn bagɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">nayi nde susɛ tiyɛ n yɛtagi?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Nde a doli n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">alogo n xa a fi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">N tan nan gbee dunuɲa seene birin na!”<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>“N mɔn xa falan ti ige yi sube ɲaxin salen seene ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">e nun a sɛnbɛ magaxuxin nun a fati faɲina.<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Nde nɔɛ a kidin bɛ a ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">Nde nɔɛ a xanle sɔxɔnɲɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">naxanye xɔdɔxɔ alo wurena?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Nde nɔɛ a gbɛgbɛni biyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">Muxune gaxuma a ɲinne nan yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>A xali xɔdɛxɛne safa wuyaxi nan a fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">e dɔxi e bode ra a fari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">alo yɛ masansan wure lefane.<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>E saxi e bode fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">hali foyen mi nɔɛ danguɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>E tugunxi e bode ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">e bode suxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">e mi nɔɛ bɛ e bode ra.”<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>“Ige yi sube ɲaxin na tison,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">kɛnɛnna yi mini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">a yɛɛne luxi alo subaxana.<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Tɛɛ dɛgɛn minima a dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">tɛɛ wolonne tuganma.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>A ɲɔɛ tutin tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">alo tunde wolonna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">alo sɛxɛ tutina.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>A ɲɔɛ foyen tigine radɛgɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">tɛɛ dɛgɛn yi mini a dɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Sɛnbɛna a kɔɛɛn nin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">gaxun nan sigama a yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>A fati kidin ɲixiriɲixirine wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">e bata xɔdɔxɔ ayi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">sese mi bama a ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>A bɔɲɛn xɔdɔxɔ alo gɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">a xɔdɔxɔ alo se kunba gɛmɛna.”<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>“A na keli, alane yi gaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">e yigitɛgɛxin yi xɛtɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Silanfanna mi sese ligama a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">hanma tanba xurin nun dɛgɛmaan nun tanba gbeena.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Wuren luxi nɛn a tan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">alo sɛxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">sulana alo wudi kunxina.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>A mi a gima xalimakunla yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">lantan gɛmɛne findixi se dagin nan na a tan xa.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Gbelemɛn luxi nɛn a tan xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">alo sɛxɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">a gelen tanban woli xuiin ma nɛn.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>A kui kidin luxi nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">alo gɛmɛ ralemunxine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">alo xɛɛ rabɔnbɔ seen naxan bubuma boroni.”<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>“A na sin fɔxɔ igen tilinna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">igen yi a ramini alo a tɛɛn nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">A fɔxɔ igeni maxama nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">alo seri igen tɛɛn ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>A funfuni yalanxin nan luma a xanbi ra igeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">a lu alo fonna xun sɛxɛn na mini fufaan fari.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>A kanna mi muxu yo ra bɔxɔ xɔnna fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">Dali seen na a ra naxan mi gaxuma.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>A yaxu sɛnbɛma yo na keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">a yɛɛn yoma na kanna ma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">bayo a tan nan sube xaɲɛne birin ma mangan na.”<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s">Yubaa yabi dɔnxɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Yuba yi Alatala yabi, a naxa,<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“N na a kolon a i nɔɛ feen birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">i nɔɛ i waxɔn feene birin nakamalɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>I yi n maxɔdin, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">‘Nde i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">naxan n ma fe ragidixine yidimima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">a xaxilitareya falane xɔn?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Awa, n yi feene falama nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">n mi yi naxanye famuma a faɲin na.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>I yi a fala n xa, i naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">‘I tuli mati, a lu n xa falan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">n xa i maxɔdin, i yi n yabi.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Awa, n bata yi i ya fe mɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">iki n yɛɛn bata i to.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Nanara, n nan n yɛtɛ yalagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">n dɔxɔ burunburunna nun xubeni nimisani.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yubaa taruxun naɲanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Alatala yelin xanbini falane tiyɛ Yuba xa, Alatala yi a fala Elifasi, Teman kaan xa, a naxa, “N ma xɔlɔn bata keli i xili ma ɛ nun i lanfa firinne, amasɔtɔ ɛ mi n ma fe falaxi tinxinni alo n ma walikɛɛn Yubaa ligaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Iki, ɛ tura solofere nun konton solofere tongo, ɛ siga n ma walikɛɛn Yuba fɛma, ɛ yi saraxa gan daxin ba ɛ yɛtɛ xa. N ma walikɛɛn Yuba n solonama nɛn ɛ xa, n yi a maxandi xuiin nasuxu, n mi ɛ suxu ɛ xaxilitareyani. Ɛ mi n ma fe falaxi tinxinni, alo n ma walikɛɛn Yubaa ligaxi kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Teman kaana Elifasi nun Suxa kaan Bilidada nun Nama kaan Sofara yi siga, e yi a liga alo Alatala a fala kii naxan yi, Alatala yi Yubaa maxandi xuiin nasuxu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Yuba yelin maxandin tiyɛ a lanfane xa waxatin naxan yi, Alatala mɔn yi a raxɛtɛ a kii fonni. Seen naxanye yi Yuba yii nun, Ala yi ne dɔxɔde firin so a yii. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Yuba tada xɛmɛmane nun a magilɛne birin yi fa a xɔntɔn e nun muxun naxanye birin yi a kolon, e yi sɛwa banden don a xɔn a konni, e yi kininkinin falane ti a xa, e yi a masabari lan gbalon ma Alatala naxan birin saxi a fari. E birin yi a ki gbetin nun xɛma yiisolirasone yi. <verse eid="JOB 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Alatala mɔn yi barakan sa Yuba siimaya dɔnxɛni dangu a fɔlɔn na, a yi yɛxɛɛ wuli fu nun naanin sɔtɔ, ɲɔgɔmɛ wuli fu nun sennin, ɲinge wuli keden, e nun sofali wuli keden. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛ solofere sɔtɔ e nun dii tɛmɛ saxan. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>A yi a singen xili sa Yemima, a firindena Kesiya, a saxandena Keren-Hapuku. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Ɲaxalan tofaɲin mi yi toɛ yamanani alo Yubaa dii tɛmɛne. E fafe Yuba yi kɛɛn so e birin yii alo e tada xɛmɛmane. <verse eid="JOB 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Na xanbi ra, Yubaa siimayaan yi siga han ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɛɛ tonge naanin, a yi a yixɛtɛne to han a dɔxɔde naanindena. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Na xanbi ra, Yuba yi faxa foriyani, a wasaxina a siimayaan na.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
